<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Benamanga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc1">Njowo ngita isimbilwe na Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Njowo Nofu chesisimbilwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohani</para>
  <para style="mt">Ulongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Njowo Nofu mukiganulo iki kyekisimbilwe na Yohani ndi kimwi pagati lya fila fitai Mulyagano lya miya fyefihumulila wumi va Yesu Kilisito. Kila kiganulo kimwi kikemelwa “Injili” mana lyake “Njowo Nofu.” Figanulo ifi fitai fyefisimbilwe chipindi Yesu peafuwe suwe, vevasimbile nde Matayo na Maliko na Luka na Yohani. Njowo Nofu ngita peisimbilwe na Yohani ivecha isimbilwe na Mnjagila Yohani kuvangila mwaka tisini peafuwe Yesu suwe. Ata ngita kiganulo sekiwonesa kuva Yohani ndeyeasimbile, ila masimbo gyake giwana hilo na baluwa lya 1 Yohani na 2 Yohani na lya 3 lya Yohani. Vasimba vangi vadahila vakalongile Yohani chipindi peakalile mumwani va Efeso, suwe iwesekana kuva kiganulo iki kisimbilwe Muefeso.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yohani ihumulila wachi kuva natilo lya kiganulo iki ndi kuvatanga vanu neke vamudikile Yesu kuva ndi Kilisito, Mwana va Nguluvi yeakwikala, musula lya 20.31. Kwa kumdikila mwene datuwanuka uwumi kuchumbila litawa lyake. Kiganulo iki kikasimbilwe neke vakwimbe vanu vonda, Vayawudi na vanu seva Vayawudi. Njowo Nofu ichi cha Yohani kwa namuna tunga sechiwana na Njowo Nofu chila chidatu. Mwene asimbile umanyitu veagitile Yesu na seasimbile hilo mifanu ga Yesu. Makani gangi makomi ngita ndeni Ubatiso va Yesu na magudo ga kula kuwelu segasimbilwe mukiganulo iki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegagehe</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani akuvanga Njowo Nofu musula lya 1.1-18</para>
  <para style="io">Baho, asimbile umanyitu geagitile Yesu musula lya 1.19—12.50</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani ihumulila makani gangi muuwumi va Yesu gegamulongocha mbaka kufuwa na kuchulubuka kwa mwene musula lya 13.1—20.31</para>
  <para style="io">Yohani imalila kusimba Njowo Nofu musula lya 21 ihumulila chipindi Yesu peavahumiye vanu peachulubuke, pambele ihumulila natilo lyake lya kusimba kiganulo iki.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Luchowo lwa uwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kuhumila pamwandi kukali na Luchowo. Uyo Luchowo akali na Nguluvi na mwene akali Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Kuhuma pamwandi Luchowo akali pamwi na Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Nguluvi awumbile finu fyonda kuchumbila mwene, kwihela kinu kyokyonda kyekiwumbilwe ngajila mwene. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Luchowo uyo akali luvangilo lwa uwumi na uwumi ugo ukaletile welu kwa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Welu ugo ung'alika mukisi na kisi lilemwile kulichima.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Nguluvi akamlagiliche mnanzi vake, litawa lyake Yohani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Yohani akachile kuvalongela vanu njowo cha welu ugo, neke vanu vonda vapulike njowo icho na kudikila. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Yohani seakali welu ugo, ila akachile kuvalongela vanu njowo cha welu. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Welu ugo ukali welu va undakyene, welu veukwacha kuinyi na kuvang'alicha vanu vonda.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Suwe, luchowo akali muinyi mumu, kuchumbila mwene Nguluvi akawumbile inyi yonda, ila vanu vonda va muinyi sevakamuchele. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Akachile kwa vanu vake, ila vanu vake sevakamwanuke. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Ila vale vanu vevamwanuke na kumwidikila, akavagitile kuva vana va Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />Vene nde vana va Nguluvi, vesevababilwe kwa kung'ang'a vanu, ila vababilwe na Nguluvi yumwene.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Luchowo ulo akachile akava munu, akalile kwa nefwe. Nefwe tuhuwene ukomi vake, ukomi vake veawanuke ngita Mwana vaweka kuhuma kwa Daada, amemile usanzi na undakyene.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yohani akavalongiye vanu njowo cha uyo munu kwa kulandula, “Uyu nde yendikali ndikuvalongela, ‘Ikwacha munu yumwi kumbele lyangu ndi mkomi kuchumba nene, kwakuva mwene akali chipindi nene ndave kubabwa.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kuhumila na uvolofu va usanzi vake, atugavile nefwe vonda lufunyo longofu. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Nguluvi atugavile Malagilicho kuchumbila Musa, ila usanzi na undakyene tuwanuke kuchumbila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Kwahela munu yeamwene Nguluvi ng'odo. Ila nefwe tumchelile Nguluvi kuchumbila Mwana va weka hela, mwene ndi Nguluvi yeagehe pamwi na Daada.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Unanzi va Yohani Mbatisa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matayo 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3.1-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Vakomi va Vayawudi va ku Yelusalemu vakavalagiliche vamonga va vatekechi na Valawi vahelele kwa Yohani mbatisa vamuhuche, “Veve ndi ani?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yohani seakanile kuvahiga, ila akavalongela undakyene kuva, “Nene se Kilisito Mkombosi yeaguliwe na Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Baho, vakamuhucha kangi, “Veve ndi ani? Wuli, veve Elia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohani akahigile, “Se nene.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Wuli, veve ndi yula mvichi Elia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">Yohani akavahigile, “Se nene!”<verse eid="JHN 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Suwe, tulongele, “Veve ndi ani? Ukwilongela liki yumwene? Tulongele, neke tuvasindikile lihigilo vala yevatulagiliche.”<verse eid="JHN 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yohani akavahigile, “Ngita pealongile mvichi Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">‘Munu yumwi ikemela kuhuma kudasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 1:23">Mugolole ng'asi lya Mtwa!’”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Vanu vala valagilichwe na Vafalisayo, <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />vakamuhucha Yohani, “Ngita veve se Kilisito Mkombosi yeaguliwe na Nguluvi, vala se Elia na se yula mvichi va Nguluvi, wuli wibatisa?”<verse eid="JHN 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohani akavahigile, “Nene ndikuvabatisa kwa malega, ila agehe yumwi pagati yenu, yesemumchele. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" />Nene ndilonguwe ila dayeikwacha, nene sendidikilwa kuwopola ndegei cha makobasi gyake.” <figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" ref="1.27">Munu afwalile makobasi</figure><verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Makani aga gagitilwe ukoya Betania, kumwambo lya mgoka Yolidani, pono peakali ibatisa Yohani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Mwanang'ondolo va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Pamilau lyake, Yohani akamwene Yesu akumwachila. Yohani akavalongela vale vanu vevagehe pala, “Lole, uyu nde Mwanang'ondolo va Nguluvi yeihecha sambi cha vanu vonda! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Uyu nde yendikavalongie makani gyake, ‘Munu yeikwacha kumbele lyangu ndi mkomi kuchumba nene, kwakuva mwene akali chipindi nene sendibabilwe.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nene sendikamchele, ila ndachile kubatisa kwa malenga neke vanu Vaisilaeli vamchele.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Yohani akavalongile gala geagawene kuva, “Ndikawonile Muhe va Nguluvi ngita ng'unda kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi na kutula mutuwe vake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nene sendikamchele, ila Nguluvi yeanilagiliche kuvabatisa vanu kwa malenga, akali andongile, ‘Yula munu dakumlola yeikwikilwa na Muhe kuhuma kuluhano na kwikala kukyanya lyake, munu uyo nde akuvabatisa kwa Muhe vangu.’” <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Baho, Yohani akalongile kangi, “Nene ndiwene lukani ulu na ndikuvalongela ndakyene kuva uyu ndi Mwana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahagula vachulila va kwanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Pamilau lyake, Yohani akali bahala pamwi na vachulila vake vavili. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Baho, akamwene Yesu ichumba, akalonga, “Lole! Uyu nde Mwanang'ondolo va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Vala vachulila vavili vakampulike Yohani akilonga njowo icho, vakamuheleliye Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu akaseduke na peavawene avo vachulila vakumuhachila akavahucha, “Mwisaka liki?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Vakamuhigile, “Rabi” Mana lyake muwulanichi, “Wikala kwiya?”<verse eid="JHN 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mwache mpalole.” Suwe, vachulila vakamuheleliye, vakapawene pono peikala, vakahuwe pamwi na mwene kigono ikyo. Ikali saa kyumi palumiye.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Yumwi va vala vavili vevakali vampulike Yohani akilonga na kumuheleliya Yesu, akali Andelea mkolo vake Simoni Peteli. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Baho baho, Andelea akahelele tandi kumlongela mkolo vake Simoni kuva, “Tumwene Mkombosi yula yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi” Mana lyake, “Kilisito.” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Baho, Andelea akamsindike Simoni kwa Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Yesu akamlolile Simoni na akalonga, “Veve ndi Simoni mwana va Yohani. Kuvangila neng'uli daukemelwa Kefa” Kwa Kigiliki ndi Peteli, Mana lyake, “Liganga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvakemela Filipo na Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Pamilau lyake, Yesu akalamuwe kuhelela muinyi lya ku Galilaya. Baho, akamwene Filipo akamlongiye, “Wache.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Filipo akali mwenekaye va ku Betisaida, mwani pevakala Andelea na Peteli. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Suwe, Filipo akamwene Natanaeli, akamlongiye, “Tumwene munu yula ngita Musa peasimbile mukiganulo kya malagilicho ngita vavichi va Nguluvi pevasimbile makani gyake. Mwene nde Yesu Mwana va Yusufu kuhuma mwani va ku Nasaleti.”<verse eid="JHN 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Ila, Natanieli akamuhucha Filipo, “Wuli, kinu kinofu kiwesa kuhuma mwani va ku Nasaleti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Filipo akamuhigile, “Wache lole.”<verse eid="JHN 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu peamwene Natanieli ikwacha kwa mwene, akalonga, “Lole! Munu uyu ndakyene ndi Muisilaeli, mwene semdesi.”<verse eid="JHN 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanieli akamuhucha, “Ukunichela wuli?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndikuwene, peukali panyi lya libiki lya mkuyu, peave Filipo kukukemela.”<verse eid="JHN 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Baho, Natanieli akamuhigile, “Veve muwalanichi, neng'uli ndichela kuva veve ndi Mwana va Nguluvi! Veve ndi Ng'achale va inyi lya Isilaeli!”<verse eid="JHN 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu akamuhuchile, “Wuli, udikila kwakuva ndikulongile kuva ndikuwene panyi lya libiki lya mkuyu? Daulola makani makomi kuchumba aga!” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Baho, Yesu akavalongela, “Ndakyene, ndikuvalongela, damwilola luhano chidinduka na kuvawona vandumindumi va Nguluvi vakikang'ala na kukwika kukyanya lya Mwana va Munu!”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Lihungu lya kutola muinyi lya Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Kigono kya udatu kukali na lihungu lya kutola kumwani va Kana inyi lya ku Galilaya. Maye vake Yesu akali pala. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu pamwi na vachulila vake vakalalikwe mulihungu lila lya kutola. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Difwayi peisilile, maye vake Yesu akamlongie Yesu, “Vanu vahela difwayi!”<verse eid="JHN 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Maye ubihile kunilongela kinu kya kugita, saa lyangu yave kufika.”<verse eid="JHN 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Maye vake Yesu akavalongiye vala vanyigendwa, “Kyokyonda kyekuvalongela, mgite.”<verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Baho, pakali na fiviya sita fitengeneswe kwa maganga. Fiviya fyefivikwile na Vayawudi ngita pevachoviye, kwakuva lya kuvikila malenga gya kwing'alila. Kila kiviya kimwi kimemechwa ndowo chivili awu chidatu gya malenga. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu akavalongiye vala vanyegendwa, “Mmemeche fiviya malenga.” Navo vakamemecha topu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Baho, Yesu akavalongie, “Nondee mnege malenga, msindikile mkomi va lihungu.” Vakagitile ngita pevalongilwe, <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />mkomi va lihungu peagechile ago malenga, gyegagalambuke kuva difwayi. Mwene seakachele yila difwayi ihumile kwiya, ila vala vanyingendwa yevanegile malenga vakachelile. Suwe, mkomi va lihungu akamkemela yeitola, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />akamlongiye, “Kila munu ihecha tandi difwayi nofu, pevigwita vagenji kunyuwa uvika yila yesenofu. Ila veve uhivikile difwayi nofu mbaka nondee!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu akagitile kimanyilo iki kya kwanja ukoya mwani va Kana, inyi lya ku Galilaya, akawonisa ukomi vake na vachulila vake vakamdikile.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Peagitile ago, Yesu pamwi na maye vake na lukolo vake na vachulila vake, vakahelela ku Kapelinaumu. Ukoya akakalile figono fidodo.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihelela kukaye kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Matayo 21.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Maliko 11.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luka 19.45-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Peikali pepi kufika lihungu lya Pasaka lya Vayawudi, Yesu akahelela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" />Peafikile palidamo lya Kaye lya Nguluvi, akavawene vanu vigucha senga na ng'ondolo na ng'unda na vanu vevakali vabadilisa sendi vakalile pamesa.<figure style="fig" file="10 Money Changer.jpg" size="col" ref="2.14">Munu ibadilisa sendi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Suwe, akabota ndegei, agitile ndomondo na akavadaga vonda kwivala lya lidamo lya Kaye lya Nguluvi pamwi na senga na vang'ondolo. Akachigalambula mesa cha vala vabadilisa sendi na kuchisukula sendi chawo, <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />na akavalongie vala vekali vigucha ng'unda, “Mufiheche finu baha, mubihile kuigita Kaye lya Daada vangu kuva pono lya kuguchila finu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Vachulila vake vakawike kuva masimbo ga Nguluvi, “Lukelo vangu kwa Kaye lyako, ukwaka mugati lyangu ngita fila lyoto.”<verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Suwe, vakomi va Vayawudi vamonga vakamuhucha Yesu, “Wuli, ugita kimanyilo liki kyekiwesa kutuwonesa kuva ugehe na umwimike va kugita makani aga?”<verse eid="JHN 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mutunyule Kaye iyi lya Nguluvi na nene ndichenga kwa figono fidatu.”<verse eid="JHN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Baho, vala Vayawudi vakamuhigile Yesu, “Kaye iyi lya Nguluvi ichengilwe kwa miyaka alobaini na sita. Wuli, veve ukulichenga kwa figono fidatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Ila Yesu seakali iywangila Kaye lya Nguluvi, ila akali iywangila njowo cha muvili vake mwene, yeukali ugehe pepi kuhanangwa. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Yesu peachulubuke, vachulila vake vakawuwike kuva akali alongile ago, vakayadikila masimbo ga Nguluvi na chila njowo chealongile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ichela mahocho gyawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu peakali ku Yelusalemu mu lihungu lya Pasaka, vanu volofu vakamwidikie pevawone kimanyilo kyeagitile. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Ila Yesu seavadikile, kwakuva akuchela makani gegagehe munumbula chawo. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Kangi, seakeliye kulongelwa makani gya munu yungi, kwakuva achelile kwa unofu makani gegagehe munumbula cha vanu vonda.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na Nikodemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kukali na kilongochi yumwi va Vayawudi yeakemeliwe Nikodemu, yeakali yumwi va lipinga lya Vafwalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Kigono kimwi Nikodemo akamuheleliye Yesu pamie, akamlongie, “Labi, twichela kuva veve ndi muwalanichi yeulagilichwe na Nguluvi. Kwihela munu yeiwesa kugita kimanyilo chechewigita veve, ngita Nguluvi seagehe pamwi nave.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndakyene ndikukulongela, kwihela munu yeiwesa kwingila mung'achale va Nguluvi ngita seibabwa kangi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo akahuchile, “Wuli, munu mgogolo iwesa kubabwa kangi?” “Wuli, iwesa kwingila kangi mulileme lya maye vake na kubabwa kangi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ndakyene ndikukulongela, kwihela munu yeiwesa kwingila mung'achale va Nguluvi ngita seibabwa kwa malenga na kwa Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Munu ibabwa kimuvili kwa daada na kwa maye, ila vanu vagalambuchwa na kuvecha mwana va Nguluvi kwa Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Ubihile kududuva kwakuva ndikulongile kuva mung'ang'wa kubabwa kangi. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Lukala upuga kwelela kweukela. Wiwesa kuupulika peupuga, ila seuchela peuhumila vala peuhelela. Ndeni, peiviye kwa munu yeababilwe kwa Muhe va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Suwe, Nikodemo akamuhuchile Yesu, “Makani aga gewesekana wuli kubabwa kwa Muhe va Nguluvi?”<verse eid="JHN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Veve ndi muwulanichi veuginywa hilo muinyi lya Isilaeli, wuli seuchela makani aga? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Ndakyene ndikukulongela, nefwe twilonga gala gyetugachele na twilonga gala gyetugalolile. Ila nyenye mukuulema unanzi vetu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Ngita nyenye semwidikila pendikuvalongela makani gegigitwa muinyi, damuwesa wuli kunidikila pendikuvalongela makani gya kuluhano kwa Nguluvi? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Kwihela munu yeyonda yeahelele kuluhano, ila Mwana va Munu weka hela, yeakwikile kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />Ngita fila Musa peamnamule yula lyoka va saba kula kukwelu, ndenindeni Mwana va Munu dainamulwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />neke kila munu yeakumdikila aveche na uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwakuva Nguluvi akuvakela hilo vanu va muinyi ata akamuhechile Mwana vake va weka hela, neke kila munu yeakumdikila abihile kuyaga, ila aveche na uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwakuva Nguluvi seamlagiliche Mwana vake muinyi neke avahige nongwa vanu va inyi, ila amlagiliche ache kuvalowola.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />Munu yeyonda yeakumdikila Mwana seakuhigwa, ila munu yeyonda yesekumdikila Mwana ahigilwe suwe, kwakuva seamdikile Mwana va weka va Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Luhigo lwene ndi ulu. Welu wachile muinyi, ila vanu volofu vakela kuvecha mukisi kuchumba kuvecha muwelu, kwakuva magito gyao mawofu. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kila munu yeigita mawofu akuuvipila welu vala seikwacha muwelu, kwakuva seakela magito gyake mawofu gawonike wachi. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Ila vala vevikwikala kwa kufwatila undakyene, neke magito gyawo gawonike gagitilwa kwa kumdikila Nguluvi yeakuvagavila ludali lya kugagita.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Pegichumbile ago, Yesu na vachulila vake vakahele muinyi lya ku Yudeya. Navo vakakalile kwa figono fidodo na kubatisa vanu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Ndenindeni, Yohani akali akuvabatisa vanu ukoya mukijiji kya Ainoni pepi na Salimu muinyi lya Samalia, kwakuva ukoya kukali na malenga myolofu. Vanu volofu vakamuheleliye Yohani neke avabatise. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Yohani akali igita kasi iyo, chipindi ave kubatwa na kumvika mukihopo.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kigono kimwi vamonga va vachulila va Yohani vakali vakulumbana na Muyawudi yumwi kwa makani gya vachoviye gya kukalava ngita peing'ang'wa kabula lya kufunya. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Suwe, vachulila avo vakamuheleliye Yohani na vakamlongie, “Muwulanichi, yula munu yeakali pamwi na veve kumwambo lya mgoka Yolidani, yula yeutulongie makani gyake na mwene ibatisa vanu, kangi vanu volofu vakumuheleliya kugina vevikwacha kwa nefwe!”<verse eid="JHN 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohani akavahigile, “Kwihela munu yeiwesa kuva na kinu ngita seagavilwa na Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Na nyenye damuvecha vaswida vangu kuva ndikalongie, ‘Nene se Kilisito, ila ndikalagilichwe neke ndimlongole.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Yeitolwa ndi vake yeakumtola. Ila mganja va yeitola, yeikwima na kumpulikicha, ukeduka hilo peakumpulika yeitola peilonga. Nondee lukeduko lwangu ikamilike. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Yesu ing'ang'wa kuvecha mkomi hilo, ila nene nding'ang'wa kuvecha mdodo hilo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwene yeihuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Mwana va Nguluvi yeikwacha kuhuma kuluhano ndi mkomi kuchumba vanu vonda. Yeihumila muinyi ndi va muinyi na ilonga makani gya muinyi. Ila yeikwacha kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi ndi mkomi kuchumba vanu vonda. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Mwene ilonga gala gyeagawonile na kupulika kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, ila vanu vadodo hela nde vikwidikila unanzi vake. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Ila yeyonda yeidikila unanzi vake, iwonesa kuva gyeilonga Nguluvi ndi gaundakyene. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Kwakuva Yula yealangilichwe na Nguluvi ilonga machowo ga Nguluvi, kwakuva Nguluvi umgavila Muhe vake neke amlongoche munu uyo kwa kila kinu kyeagita na kulonga. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Daada akumkela Mwana vake na kumgavila kila kinu akihimiliche. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Munu yeyonda yeakumdikila Mwana va Nguluvi, ivecha na uwumi va mbepali. Ila munu yeyonda yesekumdikila Mwana vake seivecha na uwumi va mbepali, kwakuva luvipo lwa Nguluvi daisigala kwa munu uyo.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na mdala Msamaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Vafalisayo vakapulike kuva Yesu akali ibatisa na kuvapata vachulila volofu kuchumba Yohani mbatisa. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Ila undakyene ndi kuva, Yesu seakabatisa, ila vachulila vake nde vakali vakubatisa. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Suwe, Yesu peapulike ago, akahuma muinyi lya ku Yudeya na kuwuya muinyi lya ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Peakali ihelela ku Galilaya akachumbile muinyi lya Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Suwe, peafikile Sikali mwani va Samaliya, pepi na mgunda va Yusufu, veagavilwe na daada vake yeikemelwa Yakobo. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Bahala kukali na kisimo kya Yakobo. Yesu akakalile mulubali lwa kisimo, kwakuva akali afwahile na lugendo. Ikali saa sita pamunyi.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Suwe, achile mdala yumwi va ku Samalia kunega malenga. Yesu akamlongie, “Ndigavile malenga ndinyuwe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Chipindi icho vachulila va Yesu vakali vahele kumwani kugula kyakulia.<verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yula mdala akamuhigile, “Veve ndi Muyawudi na nene ndi Msamalia. Wuli, uwesa kunisuka malenga gya kunyuwa?” Kwakuva Vayawudi sevihungila na sevigita kyokyonda pamwi na Vasamalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ngita uchele kila kinu kyeasaka Nguluvi kukugavila na ani yeakusuka malenga gya kunyuwa, ngaumsuka mwene na mwene ngakugavila malenga gya uwumi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yula mdala akalonga, “Mtwa, veve uhela mnechi va kunegela malenga na kisimo kyene kitali muno. Wuli, ago malenga gyekuvagavila vanu uwumi wipata kwiya? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Daada vetu Yakobo ndi yeatugavile kisimo iki. Mwene akali inyuwa malenga aga pamwi na vana vake na vang'oko vake. Wuli, ukwiwona mkomi hilo kuchumba Yakobo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Suwe, Yesu akamuhigile, “Kila munu yeinyuwa malenga aga, daivecha na ng'elu kangi. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Ila yeinyuwa malenga gendikumgavila nene, daseivecha na ng'elu mbepali. Kwakuva malenga dandikumgavila, dagavecha ngita kilwitu kya malega ga uwumi, daivecha dakumgavila uwumi va mbepali.”<verse eid="JHN 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Suwe, yula mdala akamlongile Yesu, “Mtwa, ndigavile malenga ago neke ndibihile kuvecha na ng'elu kangi na ndibihile kwacha kangi baha kunega malenga.”<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu akamlongie, “Helele ukamkemele mgosi vako, ache baha.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Yula mdala akamuhigile, “Ndihela mgosi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Yesu akamlongie, “Ulongile undakyene kuva uhela mgosi. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwakuva ukatolilwe suwe na vagosi vahanu, uyu yewikala nave nondee semgosi vako! Unilongile undakyene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yula mdala akamlongie, “Mtwa, ndiwona kuva veve ndi mvichi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Akaendeliye kulonga, “Vagogolo vetu vakamfunyile Nguluvi pakidunda iki kya Gelasimu, ila nyenye Vayawudi mwilonga kuva pono pakumfunyila Nguluvi ndi ukoya ku Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu akamlongie, “Maye, unidikile nene, chipindi chikwacha vanu dasemukumfunya Daada pakidunda iki vala ukoya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Nyenye Vasamalia mukumfunya Nguluvi yesemukumchela, ila nefwe Vayawudi tukumfunya Nguluvi yetukumchela na kuchumbila Vayawudi, Nguluvi kavakombola vanu vonda va inyi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Ila chipindi chikwacha, kangi chifikile suwe, vala vanu vevisaka kufunya kwa undakyene, davamfunya Daada ngita Muhe vake peakuwonisa peagehe va undakyene. Kwakuva Daada akuvakela vanu vevifunya ngita peikela mwene. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nguluvi ndi Muhe. Vanu vevakumfunya vang'ang'wa kumfunya ngita Muhe vake peakuvawonesa, umfunya mwene peagehe va undakyene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Suwe, yula mdala akamlongie Yesu, “Ndichela kuva Masiha yani Kilisito ikwacha, peikwacha datulongela kila kinu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Baho, Yesu akamlongie, “Nene yendilonga na veve, ndi mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Chipindi chila chila vachulila vake vakawuya, vakadudwive hilo pevamwene Yesu iywanga na mdala. Ila kwihela munu yeamuhuchile yula mdala kuva, “Wisaka liki?” Awu kumuhucha Yesu kuva, “Wuli, wiywanga na mdala uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Suwe, yula mdala akakileka kiviya kyake kya malenga bahala, akawuya kumwani na kuvalongela vanu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mwache mukamlole munu yeandilongie makani gyonda gyendigitile. Uyu ndi Kilisito?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Suwe, vanu vakahumile mumwani wula, vakamuheleliye Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Chipindi vanu wave kufika, vachulila vake vakali vakumsuka Yesu, “Muwulanichi, uliye tandi kyakula!”<verse eid="JHN 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Ila Yesu akavahigile, “Nene ndigehe na kyakula semwikichele nyenye.”<verse eid="JHN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Baho, vachulila vake vakavanga kwiwucha, “Wuli, agehe munu yeamgavile kyakula?”<verse eid="JHN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Ila Yesu akavahigile, “Kyakula kyangu ndi kugita kyeakela yula yeanilagiliche na kumalila kasi yeanigavile ndigite. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Nyenye mwilonga, ‘Gisigale myechi gitai tubene.’ Ila nene ndikuvalongela, mulole migunda peigehe suwe kwa kubenwa! <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Munu yeibena ihombwa sendi na kuvika mabenelo mulusanja kwakuva lya uwumi va mbepali. Pambele mvyalaji na munu yeibena vakeduka pamwi. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ndeni, luchowo ulu nde lya undakyene, ‘Munu yumwi ivyala na yungi ibena.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nene ndikavalagiliche nyenye mukabene mabenelo gala gyesemvyalile. Vanu vangi vakagitile kasi ng'agafu, ila nyenye mubenile kwakuva lya kasi chawo.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Vasamalia volofu va mwani wulu va Sikali vakamdikie Yesu kwakuva gya makani gala gyemlongile mdala yula, “Anilongie makani gyonda gyendigitile.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Vasamalia vakamuheleliye Yesu vakamsuka akale pamwi na vene. Suwe, Yesu akakalile mumwani ugo figono fivili.<verse eid="JHN 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Vanu volofu vakamdikila Yesu kwakuva lya unanzi vake. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Vakamlongie mdala yula, “Nefwe setudikila, kwakuva gya njowo chako hela, ila nefwe tupulike na twichela ndakyene kuva uyu ndi Mkombosi va inyi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha mwana va kilongochi yumwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pefichumbile figono fivili, Yesu akahegile bahala akahele muinyi lya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Yesu akalongile kuva, “Mvichi seiginywa kumwani vake yumwene.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Yesu peafikile ku inyi lya Galilaya, vakamuwanuka unofu, kwakuva navo vakali vahele kulihungu lya Pasaka ukoya ku Yelusalemu, vakagawene gala geagtile.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Baho, Yesu akawuyile kangi mwani va Kana ukoya ku Galilaya, ukoya peakagalambuche malenga kuva difwayi. Kukali na kilongochi yumwi akali na mwana vake mtamwa ukoya ku Kapelinaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Kilongochi yula peapulike kuva Yesu agehe ku Galilaya kuhuma Yudeya, akamuhelelie na kumsuka hilo, akamnaniche mwana vake mtamwa agehe pepi kufua. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu akamlongie, “Nyenye vanu, semudikila mbaka muwone kimanyilo na umanyitu!”<verse eid="JHN 4:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yula kilongochi akamlongie, “Mtwa, chondechonde tuhelele ukamnaniche mwana vangu, peave mwana vangu kutuleka.”<verse eid="JHN 4:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu akamlongie, “Helele, mwana vako agehe uwumi seafue.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Kilongochi yula akadikile gala gealongile Yesu, akahele. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Pehave mung'asi, akatang'anile na vanyigendwa vake, vakamlongie, “Mwana vako agehe uwumi!”<verse eid="JHN 4:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Suwe, akavahucha chipindi liki mwana vake ananile. Vene vakamuhigile, “Ikali golo saa saba pamunyi.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Baho, daada va uyu mwana, akachelile kuva mwana vake ananile chipindi chila chila pealongilwe na Yesu kuva, “Mwana vako agehe uwumi.” Suwe, kilongochi yula pamwi na vanu vevagehe mukaye lyake vonda vakamdikile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Iyi ikali kimanyilo kya uvili kyeagitile Yesu mwani va ku Galilaya, peakali ihumila ku Yudeya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akumnanicha munu va ukoya kulitanda lya Betisata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Pegachumbile ago, Yesu akahele ku Yelusalemu kulihungu lya Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Ukoya ku Yelusalemu, pepi na mulyango ukemelwa mlyangilo va ng'ondolo. Pakali na litanda lyelikemelwa kwa kibulania Betisata na lyechungutilwe na fibudi fihano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Mula mufibudi fihano vakali vigona vatamwa volofu, vabofwike meho na vatenda na venelugaso, vakali vichindila malenga gatimbwiswe. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwakuva ndumindumi va kuluhano kwa Nguluvi akali ikwika kutimbwisa malenga mulitanda lila. Mtamwa yeyonda yeakali va kwanja kwingila mumo mumalenga gegatimbwiswe, inana utamwa vovonda veanago. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Suwe, pakali na munu yumwi yeakali mtamwa kwa miyaka selasini na nane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu peamwene munu yula avasile na kuchela kuva itamika kwa figono fyolofu. Akamuhucha, “Wikela, kunanichwa?”<verse eid="JHN 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yula mtamwa akamuhigile, “Mtwa, nene ndihela munu va kunisindika mulitanda pegitimbwiswa. Kila pendigecha kwingila, munu yungi akunilongola.”<verse eid="JHN 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu akamlongie, “Wime, nyamule kitefu kyako na ugende.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Bahobaho, munu yula akananile, akanyamula kitefu kyake, akavanga kugenda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 5:9">Makani ago, gakagitile Kigono kya Kutulula, <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />suwe, filongochi va Vayawudi vakamuhucha munu yula yeananichwe na Yesu, “Wuli, unyamule kitefu neng'uli Kigono kya Kutulula? Malagilicho gyetu gikukanicha veve kutegula kitefu.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Ila mweni akavahigile, “Yula munu yeaninanile andongile, tegule kitefu kyako na ugende.”<verse eid="JHN 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Vakamuhucha, “Munu yeakulongie tegule kitefu kyako na ugende, ndi ani?” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Ila yula munu seamchele yeamnaniche akali ani, kwakuva kukali na vanu volofu na Yesu akali ahegile bahala.<verse eid="JHN 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Pambele, Yesu akatang'anile na munu yula yeamnanile Pakaye lya Nguluvi, akamlongie, “Nondee unanile, bihile kugita sambi kangi, neke ubihile kupatila lukani luhofu kugina lya pamwandi.”<verse eid="JHN 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Baho, munu yula akahele kuvalongela filongochi va Vayawudi kuva yeaninaniche, ikemelwa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwakuva Yesu akagitile lukani ulo, Kigono kya Kutulula, Vayawudi vakavanga kumusumbula. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Suwe, Yesu akavahigile, “Daada vangu igita kasi figono fyonda na nene nding'ang'wa kugita kasi ngajila kuleka.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Njowo chile chikavavipise hilo filongochi va Vayawudi. Suwe, Vayawudi vakasaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Yesu. Vakagitile ndeni, sekwakuva abedile Kigono kya Kutulula hela, ila akali akumkemela Nguluvi, Daada vake na akwiwananisa na Nguluvi.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umwimike va Mwana va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu akavahigile vala filongochi va Vayawudi ndakyene ndikuvalongela, Mwana seiwesa kugita kinu weka hela. Mwana igita kila kyeilola Daada vake igita, kwakuva kyokyonda kyeagitila Daada na Mwana igitila kiko. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Kwakuva Daada akumkela Mwana na kumuwonesa finu fyonda fyeigita mwene. Kangi dakumuwonesa finu fikomi fya kufigita kuchumba ifi na nyenye damduduva. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Ngita, fila Daada akuvachulubucha vanu na kuvagavila uwumi va mbepali na ndeni ndeni na Mwana akuvagavila uwumi vala yeavakelie. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Kangi, Daada seakumuhiga nongwa munu yeyonda yula, ila amgavile Mwana umwimike va kuhiga nongwa vanu vonda, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />neke vanu vonda vamginye Mwana ngita fila pevakumginya Daada. Munu yeyonda yesekumginya Mwana, seakumginya Daada yeamlagiliche.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela undakyene, munu yeyonda yeipulika njowo cha nene na kumdikila yula yeanilagichile nene, anago uwumi va mbepali. Daseihigwa ng'odo, ila ahagime suwe, kuhuma mukufuwa na kwingila muuwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, chipindi chikwacha, kangi ufikile suwe, vala vonda vevagehe kutali na Nguluvi davapulika lichwi lya Mwana va Nguluvi na vala vonda davapulika, daviwanuka uwumi mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ngita, fila Daada aviye na uwumi mugati lyake, ndeni ndeni amgitile mwana kuvagavila vanu uwumi. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kangi, kamgavile Mwana vake umwimike va kuvahiga nongwa vanu, kwakuva mwene ndi Mwana va Munu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mubihile kududwiva njowo ichi! Kwakuva chipindi chikwacha, vanu vonda vevagehe mukabuli davapulika lichwi lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />navo davihuma kuhuma mumakabuli gyao. Vala yevagitile finu finofu davachulubuchwa na kuhuma mukabuli yao. Davigavilwa uwumi va mbepali na vala vevakali vigitia unjanganifu davachulubuchwa na kuhuma mukabuli lyao na kuhigwa nongwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vaswida va Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />Yesu akwiilongela gyeigita, “Nene sendiwesa kugita kinu kyokyonda kwa umwimike vangu. Nene ndikuvahiga nongwa vanu kuwana na Daada peakundongela na lihigo lyangu lya ndakyene, kwakuva sendigita ngita pendikela nene, ila ndigita ngita peikela yula yeandilagiliche.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />“Ngita ndikwilongela nyenye njowo changu yune, gala gyendilonga segadikilwe kuva gya undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Ila agehe yungi yeakuchilonga njowo changu kwa nyenye na nene ndichela kuva yonda yeakundilongelela ndi ga undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Nyenye mukavalagiliche vananzi vaelele kwa Yohani mbatisa na mwene akavalongile undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nene sendihuvulila gala vanu gevakundilongelela nene, ila ndikuvalongela njowo ichi, neke mulowoliwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohani akali ngita taa yeikwaka na kulangala na nyenye mukakedukile welu lwake kwa figono fidodo. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Ila kugehe na lukani lukomi hilo lyeliwonesa kuva nene ani kuchumba gala gealongile Yohani mbatisa. Lukani lyene ndi chila kasi cheandigaviye Daada ndichigite, ago gyonda giwonesa nene ani na giwonesa Daada nde andilagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Daada mwene yeandilagiliche ndi yeakundiywagila nene ani. Nyenye semukawesile ng'odo kupulika lichwi lyake vala kumlola mwene aviye, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />vala muhela njowo chake mugati yenu, kwakuva semwikumdikila yula yealagilichwe na mwene. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mukugalola hilo Masimbo ga Nguluvi, kwakuva mwihocha kuva mugati lyake damumwanuka uwumi va mbepali. Masimbo ago gakundilongelela nene! <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Ila mwilema kwacha kwa nene, neke muwanuke uwumi va mbepali.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nene sendisaka kunjumwa na vanu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ila ndichela kuva nyenye muhela lukelo lwa Nguluvi munumbula chenu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nene ndachile kwa umwimike va Daada vangu, ila mwilema kundiwanuka. Ila munu yungi ngaikwacha kwa umwimike vake, uyo damwikumwanuka. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwikela kwinjuma mwavene, ila semugangamala kusaka uginyange weuhuma kwa Nguluvi yumwene! Nondee, damuwesa wuli kundidikila nene? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Mubihile kuhocha kuva nene dandikuvalata kwa Daada, hamu! Musa nde daakuvalata nyenye kwakuva mukumdikila mwene. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Ngita ndakyene mukamudikile Musa, suwe, ngamuwesa kundidikila nene, kwakuva mwene akasimbile njowo changu. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Ila semwidikila gala gyeasimbile Musa, muwesa wuli kudikila njowo changu chendilonga?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvagavila kyakula vanu elufu chihano</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matayo 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9.10-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Pegichumbile ago, Yesu akahagime mulihiva lya Galilaya kangi likemelwa lihiva lya Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Lipinga lya vanu lyamuhelelie Yesu, kwakuva vakali vilola umanyitu cheakali akuchigita kwa kuvananicha vatamwa. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Suwe, Yesu vakakang'ie pakidunda na akakalile, pamwi na vachulila vake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Chipindi icho, lihungu lya Pasaka lya Vayawudi ikali samba kufika. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu pealavile na kulola lipinga likomi lya vanu lyamuheleliye, akamuwucha Filipo, “Tugula kwiya kyakula kya kuliya vanu ava?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Yesu akamuwuchile Filipo ndeni, neke amgeche, kwakuva mwene achelile daigita wuli.<verse eid="JHN 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo akamuhigile, “Ata ngita datugita kasi kwa myaka gyolofu ave ngasetukali na sendi cha kuvagulila vanu ava kyakuliya!”<verse eid="JHN 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Mchulila yumwi va Yesu litawa lyake Andelea, uyo akali lukolo lwake Simoni Peteli, akamlongie, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />Andelea akamlongie Yesu, “Bahala poyuli mdimi yumwi anagyo mibumunda mihano gya sayili na fisomba fivili fidodo. Ila ifi sefikuvakwila vanu ava volofu!”<verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu akavalongela vachulila vake, “Muvalongele vanu vakale panyi.” Pono pala pakali na mikolowoga myolofu. Suwe, vanu vonda vakakalile panyi. Mulipinga lila kukali na vagosi elufu chihano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Suwe, Yesu akanyamula gila mibumunda, akamuhongiche Nguluvi, akavagavila vanu vonda yevakali pala. Akategula fisomba akagita ngita pamwandi, kila munu akaliye ngita aviye kuliya. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Vanu pevagwitile, Yesu akavalongela vachulila vake, “Mulundase fipande fyonda fyefisigie, kibihile kuyaga kinu kyokyonda.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Suwe, vakalundise fyefisigale, vakamemiche vindilu kumi na chivili.<verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Vanu pevawonile umanyitu wula weagitile Yesu, vakalonga, “Ndakyene munu uyu nde yula mvichi yetukumuhuvilila kuva daikwacha muinyi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu akachele kuva vanu vale visaka kumbata na kumvika kwa ludali kuvecha Ng'achale vawo. Ila mwene akahega akahelela kangi mukidunda weka hela.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu igenda pamalenga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matayo 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6.45-52</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Peifikile palumie, vachulila va Yesu vakahikile kuhelela kulihiva lya Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Vakaing'ile muwato na kuhagama kumwambo lya lihiva kuhelela Kapelanaumu. Kisi likaingile suwe, ila Yesu akali ave seawuyile neke aveche pamwi navo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Suwe, mulihiva kukali na madaba makomi, kwakuva lukala lukomi lukali lupuga. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Vachulila va Yesu pevakali vaendelela kusola wato utali va kilometa chihano awu sita, vakamuwona Yesu igenda pakyanya lya malenga, ikwacha pepi na wato, vakaogofya hilo. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Ila Yesu akavalongie, “Ndi nene, mubihile kuogofya!” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Vene vakasakile aingile muliwato. Bahobaho, vakafikile kumwambo pevakali vakuhelela.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vakumsaka Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Pamilau lyake, lipinga lya vanu vala vevasigalie kumwambo lungi lya lihiva, vakatambule kuva kukali na wato umwi hela pala, kangi vakachele kuva Yesu seakang'ie muwato wula pamwi na vachulila vake, ila vachulila vake vakahele weka hela. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Suwe, vanu vangi vakachile na wato chingi kuhuma ku Tibelia, chikafikile pepi na pono pala vanu pevaliye mibumunda, Mtwa peamuhongiche Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Suwe, vanu avo pevachelile kuva Yesu na vachulila vake sevagehe bahala, vakang'ile muwato icho vakahele Kapelinaumu kumsaka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi Libumunda lya Uwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Vala vanu pevamuwonile Yesu kumwambo lungi lya lihiva vakamuhuchile, “Muwulanichi, ufikile pandili kuno?”<verse eid="JHN 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mukundisaka sekwakuva mulolile umunyitu, ila kwakuva mukalie gila mibumunda mukagwite. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mubihile kugita kasi kwakuva lya kuvapatila kyakula kyekiwola, ila mugite kasi kwakuva lya kupatila kyakula sekiwola, kyekikala mbepali, fyakula ifyo dafivagavila uwumi va mbepali kuhuma kwa Nguluvi. Mwana va Munu dakuvagavila kyakula ikyo, Nguluvi Daada amgavile mwanavake umwimike va kugita ndena.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Suwe, vene vakamuhucha, “Tugite liki neke tuwese kugita gala Nguluvi geakela tugite?”<verse eid="JHN 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu akavahigile kuva, “Kasi yeikela Nguluvi muigite, kumdikila yula yeamlagiliche.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Baho, vakamuhucha, “Dawigita umanyitu liki neke tulole twiwese kukudikila? Dawigita liki? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Vagogolo vetu vakalie kyakula kyekikemelwa mana ukoya ku kwelu, ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, ‘Avagavile mibumunda gakuliya gegahumile kwa Nguluvi.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Suwe, Yesu akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, Musa seavagavile vagogolo venu mibumunda gila, ila Daada vangu nde yeakuvagavila nyenye mibumunda gya undakyene kuhuma kuluhano. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwakuva libubunda lya Nguluvi ndi yula yeikwika kuhuma kuluhano, neke avagavile uwumi va mbepali vanu vonda vevagehe muinyi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Suwe, vakamlongie, “Mtwa, kuvangila nondee utugavile libumunda ilyo, figono fyonda.”<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu akavalongie, “Nene ndi libumunda lya uwumi. Munu yeikwacha kwa nene na kundidikila, daseivecha na njala ng'odo, kangi daseivecha na ng'elu ng'odo. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Ila ngita pendivalongele kuva, ata ngita mundiwene, ila mwave semukundidikila. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Vanu vonda vendigavilwa na Daada davekwacha kwa nene na kundidikila. Kangi nene sendikumlema ata yumwi yeikwacha kwa nene, <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />kwakuva ndiikile kuhuma kuluhano neke ndiveche kugita gala geakela Daada yeandilagiliche nene. Sendachile kugita gendikela nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Mwene yeandilagiliche, ikela ndigite ndeni, ndibihile kumyagicha ata munu yumwi mugati lya vala veandigavile, ila ndivachulubuche vonda, vaveche uwumi mukigono kya mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwakuva kyeakela Daada vangu ndi iki, kila munu yeakumlola Mwana na kundidikila, aveche na uwumi va mbepali. Nene dandikwacha kumchulubucha mukigono kya mwiso.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Suwe, Vayawudi vakavanga kung'ung'ula kwakuva Yesu akalongile, “Nene ndi libumunda lyeuikile kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi.” <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Vakalonga, “Uyu munu se Yesu, mwana va Yosefu ndaa? Tuvachela daada vake na maye vake! Nondee, iwesa wuli kulonga, ahumile kwa Nguluvi?”<verse eid="JHN 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu akavahigile, “Mubihile kung'ung'ula nyenye kwa nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Kwihela munu yeiwesa kwacha kwa nene, ngita Dada yeandilagiche seamlogochile. Nene dandikumchulubucha munu uyo kigono kya mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Mukiganulo kya Nguluvi mvichi vake yumwi akasimbile ndeni, ‘Nguluvi daakuvawulanicha vanu vonda.’ Suwe, munu yeyonda yeipulikicha na kwidikila kuhuma kwa Daada, uyo daikwacha kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Kwahela munu yeamuwonile Daada, ila yula yeahumile kwa Nguluvi, mwene weka hela ndi yeamuwonile Daada. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda yeakundidikila nene anago uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nene ndi libumunda lya kyakula kyekikuvagavila vanu uwumi. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Vagogolo venu vakalie mana kula kuwelu, ila vakafue. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ila baha kugehe na libumunda lilihumile kwa Nguluvi, neke munu yeyonda dailiya daseifua. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nene ndi libumunda lya uwumi weukwikile kuhuma kuluhano kwa Nguluvi. Munu yeyonda yeilia libumunda, daikala mbepali. Libumunda ilyi ndi muvili vangu ndikuhuhecha neke vanu va inyi vaveche na uwumi va mbepali.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Suwe, Vayawudi vakavanga kwilumba vavene, “Munu uyu iwesa wuli kutugavila muvili vake, tuliye?”<verse eid="JHN 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, ngita semliya muvili va Mwana va Munu na kunyuwa danda lyake, sedamvecha na uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Munu yeyonda yeiliya muvili vangu na kunyuwa danda lyangu, agehe na uwumi va mbepali na nene dandikwacha kumchulubucha mukigono kya mwiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwakuva muvili vangu ndi kyakula kya undakyene na danda lyangu ndi danda lya undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Munu yeyonda yeiliya muvili vangu na kunyuwa danda lyangu, ikala mugati lyangu na nene ndikala mugati lyake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Ngita Daada agehe na uwumi yeandilagiliche nene, nene ndivecha uwumi kuchumbila mwene. Ndeni munu yeyonda yeilia muvili vangu, iwanuka uwumi kuhuma kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Suwe, nene ndi libubunda veuhumile kwa Nguluvi. Libubunda ili seliwana na wula wevaliye vagogolo venu. Ata ndeni vakafuwe. Ila munu yeyonda yeiliya libumunda ili daivecha na uwumi va mbepali.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu akalongile njowo ichi chipindi peagehe kuwulanicha Mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi ukoya ku Kapelinaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njowo cha uwumi cha mbepali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Vachulila vake volofu pevapulike ago, vakalonga, “Vanu sevakugachela kisatu! Ani yeiwesa kugadikila?”<verse eid="JHN 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu akachelile kuva vachulila vake vakali vakung'ung'ulika kwa gala gealongile, ngajila kulongelwa na munu. Suwe, Yesu akavahucha, “Wuli, makani aga gakuvagita muogofiye? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Daivecha wuli, dakumulola Mwana va Munu iwuya kuluhano kula peakali pamwandi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Muhe va Nguluvi nde ukuvagavila vanu uwumi. Munu seiwesa kugita kinu kyokyonda kwa ludali chake. Njowo chendivalongile ndi njowo chechihuma kwa Muhe va Nguluvi na chileta uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Ila vagehe vanu pagati lyenu vilema kudikila.” Yesu akalongile ndeni, kwakuva akachelile kuhuma pamwandi kuva ndi ani, dasekumdikila na ndi ani daakumseduka. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Suwe, Yesu akaendelie kulonga, “Kuhumila na ago, ndikavalongile kuva kwihela munu yeiwesa kwacha kwa nene, ngita Daada seamlongoche.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Kuchumbila ago, gyealongile Yesu, volofu vevamuheleliye Yesu, vakawuyile kukaye yao, vakalekile kumuheleliya Yesu kangi. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Suwe, Yesu akavahucha vala vachulila vake kyumi na vavili, “Wuli na nyenye mwisaka kuhega?”<verse eid="JHN 6:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Suwe, Simoni Peteli akamuhigile, “Mtwa, tuhege tubite kwiya? Veve unacho njowo cha uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Nefwe tudikila na tuchela kuva veve ndi yeuhanguliwe kuhuma kwa Nguluvi aviye wumi.”<verse eid="JHN 6:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu akavalongie, “Nene ndivahagule nyenye kyumi na vavili kuvecha vachulila vangu, ila yumwi pagati lyenu akulongochwa na Setani!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu akali akumlongela Yuda, mwana va Simoni Sikaliyoti. Yumwi va vachulila vake. Pambele nde akachile kumseduka Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na vakolo vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Pegachumbile makani ago, Yesu akavangile kuchungutila pono cha myani gya ku Galilaya. Seakakelie kuchungutili ku Yudea, kwakuva filongochi va Vayawudi vakasakile kumdocha. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Chipindi cha Lihungu lya Vayawudi lyelikemelwa lihungu lya fibudi likali pepi. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Suwe, vakolo vake Yesu vakamlongie, “Hege baha helele ku inyi lya Yudea, neke vachulila vako vakawone umunyitu gyeugita. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Munu yeisaka kuchelwa na vanu seigita makani kwa kufyama. Kwakuva veve ugita makani ago, suwe, uyilolese kwa vanu vonda neke vakuchele.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Vakolo vake vakalongile ndeni, kwakuva vene sevakumdikie Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu akavalongie, “Chipindi changu vakuhelela ukoya wave kufikila, ila nyenye mwiwesa kuhelela chipindi chochonda. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Vanu va inyi iyi sevavesa kuvavipila nyenye, ila vakunivipila nene kwakuva ndikuvalongela kuva vigita makani mawofu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Nyenye muhelele kulihungu, ila nene sendihelela kulihungu kwakuva chipindi vangu wave kufikila.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago, akasigalila kuko mu inyi lya Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu mulihungu lya Vayawudi lya fibudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Vakolo vake Yesu pevalonguwe kuhelela kulihungu, Yesu mwene akahelela kulihungu ila kwa kwifia. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Kula kulihungu filongosi va Vayawudi vakali vakumsaka Yesu mulihungu na vakali vakuvahucha vanu, “Agehe kwii uyu munu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kukali na luheya wolofu mulipinga lya vanu. Vakati wungi vakalongie, “Ndi munu mnofu.” Vangi vakalongie, “Hamu, akuvachanga vanu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Ila kwahela ata munu yumwi yeagecha kulonga njowo lwa Yesu pawelu, kwakuva vakaogwipe vala filongosi va Vayawudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Lihungu peifikile pagati, Yesu akahelela ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, akavanga kuwulanicha. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Suwe, Vayawudi vakadudwive na kulonga, “Munu uyu awesile wuli kuchela ngajila seayiwulaniche?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Baho, Yesu akavahigile, “Mawulanicho gyendiwulanicha seganene, ila gihuma kwa Nguluvi yeanilagiche. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Munu yeikela kugita gala geikela Nguluvi, ichela ngita mawulanicho aga gahumile kwa Nguluvi, awu gendilonga nde mwene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Munu yeilonga makani gyake mwene isaka anjumwe mwene. Ila yula yeisaka yula yeandilagiliche anjumwe ndi ilonga gya undakyene na vala semdesi. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Wuli, Musa seakavagavila malagilicho? Ata ndeni, kuhela ata yumwi venu yeikolela malagilicho. Kwa liki mwisaka kundidocha?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Baho lipinga lya vanu vakamuhigile, “Veve ugehe lihoka! Ndi ani yeisaka kukudocha?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndigitile umunyitu umwi na nyenye vonda mukadudwive. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Musa avalagiche nyenye muvadumule bina vana venu vakigosi, kulonga undakyene lukani ulo lukavangichwe na vakukuu venu na sekwa Musa, ila nyenye mwidumula bina vana venu ata Kigono kya Kutulula. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Suwe, ngita munu iwesa kudumulwa bina Kigono kya Kutulula neke mukolele malagilicho gya Musa, wuli mukunivipila nene kwakuva ndimnaniche munu Kigono kya Kutulula? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mubihile kumuhiga munu kwa makani gegiwoneka kwivala, ila mumhige munu kwa undakyene na peing'ang'wa.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuli, Yesu ndi Kilisito Mkombosi yeaguliwe na Nguluvi?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Vanu vamonga va ku Yelusalemu vakalongile, “Uyu seyula munu yevakumsaka vamdoche na filongochi? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mulole iywanga pawelu hela, vala kuhela munu yeilonga kinu kyokyonda! Wuli, yivecha filongochi vichele undakyene kuva uyu ndi Kilisito Mkombosi yeaguliwe na Nguluvi? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Ila Kilisito Mkombosi dapeikwacha kwihela munu daichela peahumile, ila nefwe tuchela peahumile munu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Suwe, Yesu peikali iwulanicha ku Kaye lya Nguluvi akaywangile kwa lichwi ngomi, “Ndakyene mukunichela nene, kangi mukupachela pendihumile! Nene sendachile kwa umwimike vangu yune. Ila yeandilagiliche nene ndi va undakyene. Nyenye semukumchela. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Ila nene ndikumchela kwakuva ndihumile kwa mwene na mwene ndi yeandilagiliche.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Suwe, vanu vakasakile kumbata, ila kwihela munu yeagechile kumbata, kwakuva chipindi chake chave kufika. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Ila vanu volofu vevakali pala vakamudikile Yesu, vakali valonga, “Wuli, Kilisito Mkombosi daikwacha, daigita umanyitu myolofu kugina gyeagitile munu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vadima valagilichwa kumbata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Vafalisayo vakavavapulike vanu viheya makani ago kutigila Yesu. Suwe, vene pamwi na vatekechi vakomi, vakavalagiliche vadima neke vakambate Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Baho, Yesu akavalongela kuva, “Dandivecha na nyenye kwa chipindi chidodo hela, baho dandiwuya kwa yula yeandilagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Damukundisaka, ila dasemukunilola, kangi semuwesa kwacha pala pendivecha.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Suwe, filongochi va Vayawudi vevakali pala vakwiwucha vene kwa vene, “Munu uyu ihelela kwiya, pono nefwe setuwesa kumuwona? Wuli, daihelela kwa Vayawudi yevatawanyike muinyi lya Vagiliki na kuvawulanicha Vagiliki? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Wuli, isika kutulongela liki kwa njowo ichi cheilonga, damukundisaka, ila dasekuniwona, kangi dasemuwesa kwacha pendigehe nene?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fipengo fya malenga gya uwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Kigono kya mwiso, kigono kila kikomi kya lihungu lya fibudi. Suwe, Yesu akawime, akalonga kwa lichwi ngomi, “Munu yeagehe na ng'elu ache kwa nene anyuwe malenga. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Ngita peisimbilwe mumasimbo ga Nguluvi kuva, ‘Munu yeyonda yekunidikila nene, daivecha na fipengo fya malenga gya uwumi gipogoma munumbula lyake!’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu akali iywangila makani ga Muhe va Nguluvi, yula daikumdikila daakumuwanuka. Chipindi icho, Nguluvi akali ave semuhechile Muhe vake, kwakuva Nguluvi seakali ave seawonisile pawelu ukomi va Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu vakwinenga kwakuva lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Vanu vangi mulipinga lila pevapulike njowo icho, vakavangile kulonga kuva, “Ndakyene, munu uyu ndi yula mvichi yetukumuchindila kuhuma kwa Nguluvi!” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Vanu vangi vakalongile, “Munu uyu ndi Kilisito Mkombosi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Ila vangi vakalongile, “Hamu! Kilisito Mkombosi yeaguliwe na Nguluvi seawesa kuhuma muinyi lya ku Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Msimbo ga Nguluvi gilonga Kilisito Mkombosi ihuma muulelo va Dawudi. Kangi, daibabwa ku Betelehemu, mumwani veakalile Dawudi!” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Suwe, vanu vakayinengile kwakuva lya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Vanu vangi vakasakile kumbata Yesu, ila kwihela munu yeagechile kumbata.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filongochi va Vayawudi sevakumudikila Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Suwe, vala vadima vakawuya kangi kwa vatekechi vakomi na Vafalisayo, vala vevalagilichwe kumbata Yesu, vakahuchwa, “Kwa liki semumbatile Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 7:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Vala vadima vakavahiga, “Kwihela munu yeakawaile kulonga ngita peilonga munu uyu!”<verse eid="JHN 7:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Vafalisayo vakavahucha, “Wuli na nyenye avachangile?” <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />“Wuli, kugehe na kilongochi yeyonda yula awu Mfalisayo yeamukumchela? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Ila lipinga lya vanu vevamuidikiye sevachele malagilicho ga Musa vakotoliwe na Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Baho, yumwi va Mfalisayo litawa lyake Nikodemo, yula yeamuhelelie Yesu kigono kimwi pamie. Suwe, akavalongie, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Wuli, malagilicho geatugavile Nguluvi kuchumbila Musa, sechikutukanicha kumuhiga munu nongwa ngajila kumpulikicha tandi na kuchela geagitile?”<verse eid="JHN 7:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Vene vakamuhigile, “Wuli, veve ndeni uhumile muinyi lya Galilaya? Helele, ukakwimbe unofu kangi Masimbo ga Nguluvi, dauchela kuva kwihela mvichi Nguluvi yeihuma muinyi lya Galilaya!”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Baho, vakahegile, kila yumwi akawuya kukaye lyake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Mdala yeabatilwe akigita ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Ila Yesu akahelela kukidunda kya miseituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Pamilau lyake mbugamie akahele kangi ku Kaye lya Nguluvi. Vandu vonda vakamuhelelie, mwene akakalile panyi na kuvanga kuvawunanicha. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Vawulanichi va malagilicho na Vafalisayo vakamletile mdala yumwi yeibatilwe muugoni. Vakamwimiche pagati lyawo. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Suwe, vakamuhucha Yesu, “Muwulanichi! Mdala uyu tumbatile muugoni. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Mumalagilicho ga Musa geagavilwe na Nguluvi, gikutuwulanicha nefwe kuva mdala ngita uyu atovwe maganga mbaka afuwe. Wuli, veve wilonga liki?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Vene vakalongile ndeni neke vapate nongwa lyelikumgita va mlate. Ila Yesu akagundama, akasimbile panyi kwa kyala kyake. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pevaginile kumuhucha Yesu akawime, akavalongie, “Ngita agehe munu yeihela sambi pagati lyenu, aveche va kwanja kumtova liganga mdala uyu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Suwe, Yesu akagundama kangi, akasimbile panyi kwa kyala kyake. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Pevapulike ago, vakavanga kuhega yumwi yumwi, vakalonguwe vagogolo na vakafwatile vadimi kuhega. Yesu akasigalie weka hela pamwi na yula mdala, akali ahimile pautalo lyake. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Suwe, Yesu akahimile, akamuhucha yula mdala, “Vahele kwiya vevakali vakukulata? Wuli, kwahela munu yeasigale neke akuhige nongwa?”<verse eid="JHN 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Yula mdala akamuhigile, “Mtwa, kwihela ata yumwi yeanihigile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Suwe, Yesu akamlongie, ata nene sendikuhiga helele, ila kuvangila neng'uli mubihile kugita sambi kangi.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi welu va inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Suwe, Yesu akaendelele kuvalongela lila lipinga lya vanu, “Nene ndi welu va inyi. Munu yeyonda yeikwacha kwa nene, daseigenda ng'odo mukisi, ila daivecha na welu veukumlongocha muuwumi va mbepali.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Suwe, Vafalisayo vakamlongie Yesu, “Veve ukwilongela yuve, ila kwihela munu yeidikila njowo chako cheulonga.”<verse eid="JHN 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ata ngita ndikwilongela yune, gendilonga ndi ga undakyene, kwakuva ndichela kwendihuma na kwendihelela. Ila nyenye semchela kwendihuma vala kwendihelela. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Nyenye muhiga nongwa munu kwa kumlola kwivala, ila nene sendimuhiga munu yeyonda. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Ila ata ngita ndihiga nongwa, ndihiga nongwa ngita peing'ang'wa, kwakuva sendihiga weka hela, ila ndihiga nongwa pamwi na Daada yeandagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Isimbilwe Mumalagilicho gyenu gemgavilwe na Musa kuva, uswida va vanu vavili, ndi undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Ndeni, nene ndikwilongela yuve na Daada yeandilagiliche ndi mswida vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Suwe, Vafalisayo vakamuhucha Yesu, “Daada vako alikwiya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">Yesu akavahigile, “Nyenye semukundichela nene vala semumchela Daada. Ngita ngamunichele nene, suwe ngamumchela Daada vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu alongile ago gyonda peawulanicha ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, pono pevakali vivika lisanduku lya usembe. Ila kukala kwihela munu va kumbata, kwakuva kigono kyake kikali kyave kufika.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwendihelela damuwesa kufika ng'odo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu akavalongie kangi, “Nene ndihelela nyenye mukundifuatila, ila mwifua mu sambi chenu. Kwendihelela nene, nyenye semwesa kufikila.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Vakomi va Vayawudi vakalonga, “Manyi akwidocha? Wuli, ilonga kwendihelela nyenye semwesa kufikila?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu akavalongie, “Nyenye va muhumile baha panyi, nene ndihumile kukyanya. Nyenye ndi va muinyi iyi, nene sevainyi iyi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Kwakuva ndivalongelege mwifua mu sambi chenu. Ngita semwidikila kuva, ‘Nene ndi yula yendikali ndikuvalongela kuhuma pamwandi.’”<verse eid="JHN 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Vene vakamuhucha, “Veve ani?” Yesu akavahigile, “Ndivalongie kuhuma pamwandi! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Ndigehe na makani molofu gya kuvalongela na kuvahinga nyenye. Ila yula yeandilagiliche ndi va undakyene na nene ndikuvalongela vanu vonda gala gyendikapulike kuhuma kwa mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Vene sevachele kuva Yesu akali akilonga makani gya Daada vake va kuluhano. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Baho Yesu akavalongie, “Pemukumnamula Mwana va Munu, baho pemuchela kuva, ‘Nene ndi mwene,’ sendigita finu fyonda kwa umwimike vangu, ila ndigita gala Daada geandiwulaniche. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yula yeandilagiliche agehe pamwi na nene, mweni seandilekile weka hela, kwakuva figono fyonda ndigita gala geing'ang'a mwene.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Peamalile kulonga ago vanu volofu vakamdikila.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vachulila va undakyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Yesu akavalongie vala Vayawudi vevamdikile, “Ngita muginya mawulanicho gyangu ndakyene muvecha vachulila vangu va ndakyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Baho, damchela undakyene. Suwe, kwa ng'asi lya undakyene uwo, Nguluvi daakuvalekela kuhuma mu usutu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Vene vakahigile, “Nefwe ndi ulelo va Ibulahimu na setukali vanyigendwa va munu yeyonda yula. Ulonga wuli kuva, ‘Datuvecha pekesu?’”<verse eid="JHN 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda yeigita sambi ndi msutu. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Msutu seakwikala kukaye igita kasi figono fyonda, ila mwana ikala kukaye mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Suwe, Mwana peakuvalekelela kuhuma muusutu va sambi, suwe, damvecha pekesu ndakyene. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndichela kuva nyenye ndi ulelo va Ibulahimu. Ila mwikela kundidocha kwakuva mulema kwanuka mawulanicho gyangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nene ndilonga gala gyendilolile kwa Daada, ila nyenye mwigita gala gyeavalongie daada venu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Vene vakamhigile, “Nefwe daada vetu ndi Ibulahimu!” Yesu akavalongie, “Ngita nyenye ngamuvechile vana va Ibulahimu, ngamugita gala geakagitile Ibulahimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nene ndivalongila undakyene vendiupulike kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, ata ndena nyenye mwikela kundidocha. Ibulahimu seagagitile ndena! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Nyenye mwigita makani galagala gyeakagitile daada venu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Vene vakamlongie, “Nefwe ndi vana va undakyene va Nguluvi, tugehe na daada yumwi hela mwene ndi Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ngita Nguluvi ngaavechile Daada venu, ngamundikela, kwakuva nene ndihumile kwa Nguluvi na neng'uni ndigehe baha. Sendachile kwa umwimike vangu ndi yune, ila Nguluvi yumwene ndi yeandilagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Wuli semchela aga gyendilonga? Kwakuva mulema kupulika unanzi vangu. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Nyenye daada venu ndi Setani, mwigita makani gyeagitile daada venu. Kuhuma pamwandi mwene akali akuvadocha vanu. Seikela kugita gegagehe gya undakyene, kwakuva undakyene ihela munumbula lyake, Peilonga udesi Setani ndi kyanda kyake, kwakuva mwene ndi mudesi na daada va udesi. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Nene ndilonga undakyene, ila nyenye semukundidikila. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Ni ani mugati lyenu iwesa kulonga undakyene kuva nene ndigehe na nogwa kwa Nguluvi? Ngita nene ndilonga undakyene wuli semukundidikila? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Yula yeahumile kwa Nguluvi, akupulika gya Nguluvi. Ila nyenye semupulika kwakuva nyenye sevana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Vayawudi vakamlongie Yesu, “Wuli, nefwe setukalongile kuva veve ndi Msamalia na ugehe na lihoka?”<verse eid="JHN 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu akahigile, “Nene ndihela lihoka, nene ndikumginya Daada vangu, ila nyenye semukundiginya. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nene sendisaka vanu vaniginye, ila agehe yumwi yeing'ang'a vanu vaniginye na mwene nde muhiga va makani ago. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongila, munu yeyonda yeakuuginya unanzi vangu daseafua mbepali.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Vayawudi vakamlongile, “Nondee tuchela kuva veve ugehe na lihoka! Ibulahimu afue na vatekechi navo vafue, nondee veve ukutulongela munu, ‘Yeiginya unanzi vangu seafua mbepali!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Wuli ukwigita kuva mkomi kuchumba daada vetu Ibulahimu yeafue? Na vatekechi vafue. Veve ukwigita kuva ani?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ngita ndikwinjuma yune Ukomi vangu sekinu. Ila Daada vangu ndi yula nyenye mwilonga ndi Nguluvi venu ndi yeakuninjuma nene. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Vala nyenye semwimchela, ila nene ndimchela. Ndikilonga sendimchela, ndivecha mdesi ngita nyenye, nene ndimchela na ndikulikolela njowo chake. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Ibulahimu, daada venu akakedukile hilo kuchela kuva nene dandikwacha. Akali ngita andiwene, akakedukile hilo.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Vayawudi vakamlongie, “Veve uhela miyaka milongu mihano, nave umuwonile Ibulahimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvangela peave kubabwa Ibulahimu, nene ndibabilwe daa.” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Baho, vakahola maganga neke vamtove, ila Yesu akafyama, pambele akahumile ku Kaye lya Nguluvi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumnanicha munu yeababilwe abofwike meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu peakali ichumba amuwonile munu yumwi, abofwike meho kuhuma pebabilwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Vachulila vake vakamuhucha, “Muwulanichi! Ndiani yeagitile sambi, munu uyu awu vala yevambabile?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu akahigile, “Uyu seagitile nongwa na vala yevambabile sevagitile sambi, ila ababilwe abofwike meho neke ludali cha Nguluvi iyonike ikigita kasi mugati lyake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kukiva ave palumie tuendelise kugita kasi cha yula yeandilagiliche, kwakuva pamie ukwacha munu seiwesa kugita kasi. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Pendave muinyi, nene ndi welu va inyi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Peamalile kulonga ago, akafunya miti panyi, akahanganise na uganga likahumila lidope, akambaka yula yeabofwike meho muwuso, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />akamlongie, “Helele ukakalave mulitanda lya Siloamu.” Siloamu mana lyake ndi “Yealagilichwe” Baho yula yeabofwike meho akahelela, akakalava wuso, akawuya kuno akilola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Vala vapepi vake na vala vevamuwonile pamwandi kuva muhangala, vakalonga, “Uyu munu seyula muhangala yeakali akwikala kuno akivasuka vanu?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Vanu vamonga vakalonga, “Uyu mwene.” Vangi vakalonga, “Semwene ila awanine na mwene.” Ila yula yeabofwike meho akalonga, “Ndi nene!”<verse eid="JHN 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Vene vakamuhucha, “Nondee meho gako gadindwike wuliwuli?”<verse eid="JHN 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Mwene akahigila, “Yula munu yeakemelwa Yesu akayangasile uganga, akanibakile mumewo na akandilongie, helele ukakalave wuso mulitanda lya Siloamu. Baho, ndikahelela ndikakalava bahobaho ndikavanga kuwona.”<verse eid="JHN 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Vakamuhucha, “Munu uyu agehe kwii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Mwene akavahigile, “Nene sendichela!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vafwalisayo vasaka undakyene vakunanichwa kwa yula yeabofwike meho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Baho vakamsindika yula munu yeabofwike meho kwa Mafwalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kigono ikyo Yesu peangalise uganga na kumdindula meho munu uyo, ikali Kigono kya Kutulula. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Mafwalisayo vakamuhucha yula munu yeabofwike meho, “Undindweke wuliwuli meho gako?” Mwene akavalongie, “Andibakile uganga mumewo, na nene ndikakalave wuso na ino ndilola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Vafwalisayo vamonga vakalonga, “Munu uyu seahumile kwa Nguluvi, kwakuva seakolela Malagilicho gya Kigono kya Kutulula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Ila volofu vakalonga, “Munu munya sambi iwesa wuli kugita umunyitu fyandehe?” Vakainengile mugati yao.<verse eid="JHN 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Vakamuhucha kangi yula munu yeabofwike meho, “Veve wilonga wuli kugitila munu uyu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Mwene akavalongie, “Yula ndi mvichi va Nguluvi!”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Vilongochi va Vayawudi sevakadikila kuva munu uyu akali seilola pamwandi na nondee ilola, mbaka pevakemelwe vasasi vake. <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />Vene vakavahucha, “Uyu mwana venu mumbabile abofwike meho? Ino andindwike wulwuli meho gake na ino ilola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Vasasi vake vakahigile, “Tuchela kuva uyu mwana vetu na akababilwe ndena abofwike meho. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Nefwe setuchela kuva awesile wuli kulola na vala setuchela yula yeamdinduwe meho gake. Mumhuche mwenyekaye, kwakuva uyu ndi munu mkomi, iwesa kuywanga!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Vasasi vake valongile ndena kwakuva vakavakogwipe filongochi va Vayawudi, vene valonganile munu yeyonda dayeilonga pawelu kuva Yesu ndi Kilisito yeaguliwe daidagwa kwivala lya ku kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Ndena, vasasi vake vakalongie, “Mumhuche mwenekaye kwakuva ndi munu mkomi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Vakamkemela kangi yula munu yeabofwike meho, vakamlongie, “Longe undakyene pautalo lwa Nguluvi! Nefwe tuchela kuva munu uyu agitile nogwa kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Mwene akahigile, “Ngita ndi gitile nongwa nene sendichela. Ila kinu kimwi ndichela, ndikali ndibofwike meho na ino ndilola.”<verse eid="JHN 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Vene vakamuhucha, “Akakugitile liki? Akudinduwe wuli meho gako ago?”<verse eid="JHN 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Yula munu akavahigile, “Ndivalongile suwe, semkandipulikile, kwaliki mwikela kupulika kangi? Nyenye mwikela kuva vachulila vake?”<verse eid="JHN 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Ila filongochi va Vayawudi vakamligile vakilonga, “Veve ndi mchulila vake, nefwe ndi vachulila va Musa! <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Nefwe twichela kuva Nguluvi aywangile na Musa, ila munu uyu setwichela ahumile kwii!”<verse eid="JHN 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Munu uyo akavahigile, “Lukani ulu lya kududwiva! Nyenye semchela ahumile kwii, ila andidindule meho gangu! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Twichela kuva Nguluvi seakuvapulikicha vanu vevagitile nongwa, ila akumpulika munu yeyonda yula yeigita gala gegakumkelesa Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Kuhuma peyiwumbilwe inyi kuhela munu yeyonda yeampulike munu amnaniche munu yeabofwike meho. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Ngita munu uyu seahumile kwa Nguluvi, ngaseiwesa kugita kinu kyokyonda!”<verse eid="JHN 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Vakamuhigile, “Veve ubabilwe na kulelwa mu nogwa, uwesa wuli kutuwulanicha nefwe?” Vakamdaga kwivala lya Kaye lya kufunyila.<verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filongochi va Vayawudi sevakumchela Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu peapulike kuva vamdagile munu yula. Akahele kumsaka, peamwene akamuhucha, “Wuli, veve umdikila Mwana va Munu?”<verse eid="JHN 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Munu yula akahigile, “Ndi ani? Ndilongele neke ndiwese kumdikila!”<verse eid="JHN 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu akamlongie, “Umuwonile suwe, uyu yeuywanga nave.”<verse eid="JHN 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Munu yula akalonga, “Ndikudikila Mtwa!” Baho akamfugamile pautalo Yesu na kumfunya.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu akalonga, “Nene ndachile ku inyi kuhiga nongwa vanu, neke vala yevabofwike meho vavese kulola na vala yevihocha vilola vaveche vabofwike meho.”<verse eid="JHN 9:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Vamonga va Mafwalisayo vevagehe pamwi na Yesu vakapulike gyealongile, vakamuhucha Yesu, “Ndakyene nefwe tubofwike meho?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ngita mungali mubofwike meho, semungali na nogwa, ila nondee nyenye mwilonga, nefwe tulola, suwe muna na nongwa.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Mufwano va mkwamila msanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, munu yeyonda seikwingila mukivingilili lya ng'ondolo kwa kuchumbila mulwichi, ila ekwingila kuchumbila ng'asi yingi, uyo mwichi na mnyaga. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Ila yeikwingila kwa kuchumbila kumlyangilo, uyo ndi mkwamila va ng'ondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Mdima va likivingilili ekumdindulila mkwamila lwichi na ng'ondolo vakumpulika lisauti lyake. Ekuvakemela ng'ondolo vake kwa matawa gyao na kuvahumicha kwivala. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Peakuvahumicha ng'ondolo vonda kwivala, ilongola kuutalo lyao na ng'ondolo vakumfuatila kwakuva vaichela lisauti lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ila ng'ondolo seviwesa kumfuatila mgenji, ila vekumyila kwakuva sevaichela lichwi lyake.”<verse eid="JHN 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu avalongie mfwano ugo, ila vao sevachele gyeakali akuvalongela.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi mkwamila msanzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Yesu akavalongela kangi, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, nene ndi lwichi lwa ng'ondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Vala vangi vonda yevandilonguwe nene ndi vahichi na vanyaga na ng'ondolo sevakavapulike. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nene ndi mlyangilo. Munu yeyonda yeikwingila kwa kuchumbila nene dailowolwa, daikwingila na kuhuma na daipata kila kyeing'ang'a. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mwichi ikwacha neke ahiche, adocha na ahanange. Ila nene ndachile neke vapatile uwumi va mbepali.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Nene ndi mkwamila msanzi. Mkwamila msanzi ihumicha uwumi vake kwakuva lya ng'ondolo chake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Munu yeagita kasi lya kukwamila neke ipatile sendi na ng'ondolo sevake, peilola likeve likwacha, akuvaleka kondolo na kunyila, baho likeve akuvabata na kuvayaganisa mudasi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Mkwamila inyila kwakuva ilolela sendi ng'ani, ila seakuvalola unofu ng'ondolo avo. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nene ndi mkwamila msanzi. Ndikuvachela ng'ondolo vangu na vevagehe va nene vakundichela. <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />Ngita ndeni Daada peakundichela nene, ndenindeni na nene ndikumchela Daada. Ndidikila ata kufuwa neke ng'ondolo vangu vabihile kuyaga. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kangi ndigehe na ng'ondolo vangi, vala sevagehe mukivingili ilyi. Na nene nding'ang'wa kuvalongocha. Ng'ondolo avo davakuichela lichwi lyangu, ndeni dakuvecha lipinga limwi na mkwamila yumwi.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Daada akundikela, kwakuva nene dikuhumiche kufuwa neke ndipatile uwumi kangi. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Kuhela munu yeakundinyaga uwumi vangu, nene ndikuhuhecha pendikela nene. Ndigehe na umwimike va kuhuhecha na kuwutegula kangi. Ndeni nde ndilagichwe na Daada vangu kugita.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Pevapulike njowo icho Vayawudi vinengile kangi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Volofu vawo vakalongie, “Agehe na lihoka, kangi ana lukwale! Wuli tukumpulika?”<verse eid="JHN 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Vangi vakalongie, “Malichwi aga se gya munu munya lisoka. Lihoka liwesa kudundula meho ga munu yaebofwife meho?”<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi vakumlema Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Ukoya ku Yelusalemu kukali na lihungu lya kuwiwuka kung'alicha unofu Kaya lya Nguluvi, chipindi ichi kikali cha ng'ala. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Yesu akali igendagenda ku Kaye lya Nguluvi muludamwa lwa Solomoni, <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />suwe, Vayawudi vakamchungatile, vakamuhucha, “Ukutufwiya undakyene mbaka pandili? Utulongele undakyene tuchele ngita veve ndi Kilisito yeaguliwe na Nguluvi?”<verse eid="JHN 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu akavahigile, “Ndikavalongie, ila nyenye semudikila. Kasi ichi chendigita nene kwa umwimike va Daada vangu ndechikunilongela nene ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Ila nyenye semdikila kwakuva nyenye seng'ondolo vangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ng'ondolo vangu vipulika lichwi lyangu, nene ndikuvachela, navo vakundifutila. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nene ndikuvagavila uwumi va mbepali, vene sevayagila mbepali, vala kuhela munu yeiwesa kuvahecha mumawoko gyangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Daada vangu yeandigavile ava ndi mkomi kuchumba vonda na kuhela yeiwesa kuvahecha mumawoko gya Daada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nene na Daada ndi kinu kimwi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Vayawudi vakahola maganga neke vamtovile neke vamdoche. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndigitile kasi cholofu kuhuma kwa Daada. Kasi liki mugati gya igo gyekuvagita munditove maganga?”<verse eid="JHN 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Vayawudi vakamuhigile, “Setukutovela maganga kwakuva lya kasi nofu gyeugitile, ila tukutova kwakuva lya kumliga Nguluvi! Ukwigita kuva Nguluvi kuno veve munu hela ngita vanu vangi.”<verse eid="JHN 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu akavahigile, “Wuli, seisimbilwe Mumalagilicho gyenu kuva, Nguluvi alongile, ‘Nyenye ndi vanguluvi vangi?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Nguluvi avakemeliye vanguluvi vangi vala vevagavilwe unanzi vake, nefwe tuchela kuva Msimbo gya Nguluvi gilonga undakyene figono fyonda. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Wuli mwilonga kuva, mwene Daada akamuhaguwe na kumlagicha ku inyi, nyenye mukumlongela, akumliga Nguluvi kwakuva ndilongie, Nene ndi Mwana va Nguluvi? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ngita sendigita kasi cha Daada vangu, mbihile kundidikila. <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />Ila pendikuchigita kasi cha Daada, ata ngita semukundidikila nene, suwe, muchidikile icho kasi, neke mpatile kuchela kuva Daada agehe mugati lyangu na nene ndigehe mugati lyake.”<verse eid="JHN 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Vakagechile kangi kumbata ila akacholopwike mumawoko gyawo.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu akahelela kangi kumwambu lya mgoka Yolidani, kula kweakali ibatisa Yohani, akakalile ukoya. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Vanu volofu vamuheleliye vakamlongie, “Yohani seagitile umanyitu wowonda. Ila makani gonda ga Yesu cheakali achilongile chikali cha undakyene.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Suwe, vanu volofu vevakali pala vakamdikila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kufua kwa Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Suwe, kukali na munu yumwi litawa lyake Lasalo, mwenekaye va ku Betania, akali mtamwa. Mwani va Betania kikali pono pevakali vakwikala Malia na Malita, vahacha vake. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia ndi yula yeambakile Mtwa mafuta ga manung'ililo na kumfyangusa magulu gyake kwa fwili chake. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Suwe, vahacha vake Lasalo Malia na Malita vakalagiliche unanzi kwa Yesu, vakalongile, “Mtwa, mganja vako Lasalo mtamwa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu peapulike njowo icho, akalongile, “Utamwa ugu, sevakumdocha Lasalo, ila dauguvagita vanu vamnjume Nguluvi na kuchumbila ago Mwana va Nguluvi kange dainjumwa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu akavakelie hilo Malita na vakolo vake, Malia pamwi na Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Suwe, Yesu peapulike kuva Lasalo itamika, akahongeliche kukala pono baho kwa figono fivili. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Suwe, akavalongela vachulila vake, “Tuhelele kangi muinyi lya Yudea!”<verse eid="JHN 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Vachulila vake vakamuhigile, “Muwulanichi! Chipindi kidodo hela kichumbile Vayawudi vakasakile kukutova na maganga ukoya. Wuli, wisaka kuhelela kangi ukoya?”<verse eid="JHN 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu akahigile, “Wuli, masaa gya pamunyi se kyumi na chivili? Ndeni, vala vevagenda pamunyi, seawesa kwikwambadula mgulu vake kwakuva vilola welu va muinyi iyi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Ila munu yeigenda pamie akwikwambadula kwakuva welu kwihela.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu peakali ilonga ago, akaendelela kuvalongela vachulila vake kuva, “Mganja vetu Lasalo avasile, ila ndihelela kumlamsa.”<verse eid="JHN 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Vachulila vake vakamuhigila, “Mtwa, ngita avasile tulo, dailamka.”<verse eid="JHN 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Ila vachulila vake vakahochile kuva Lasalo avasile tulo, Yesu akali ilonga kuva Lasalo afuwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Suwe, Yesu akavalongie undakyene kuva, “Lasalo afue, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ila nene ndikeduka kwakuva sendikali ukoya peafue Lasalo, neke nyenye mpatile kunidikila. Suwe, tuhelele kwa Lasalo.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Suwe, mchulila yumwi litawa lyake Tomasi yevakamkemela Pacha, akavalongela vachulila veyage kuva, “Tuhelele na nefwe, neke tukafue pamwi nave!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nde akuvachulubula vanu kuvagavila uwumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu pafikile ukoya akawene likabuli, lyeakawekilwe Lasalo kwa figono fitai. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kijiji cha Betania ukali pepi na ku Yelusalemu, utali vake ukali ngita kilomita chidatu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Vayawudi volofu kuhuma Yudea vakachile mukijiji kya Betania, kuvanamacha Malita na Malia kwakuva lya kivembo cha maama vawo.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Suwe, Malita peapulike kuva Yesu ikwacha, akahelela kumuwanuka, ila Malia akasigalile mukaye. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita akamlongie Yesu, “Mtwa, ngita ngauvechile baha, maama vangu ngaseafua! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Ila ata nondee ndichela kuva kyokyonda dakyeumsuka Nguluvi, daakugavila.”<verse eid="JHN 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Suwe, Yesu akamuhigile, “Maama vako daachulubuka na kuvecha uwumi kangi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita akamuhigile, “Ndichela kuva daichulubuka chipindi vanu dapevichulubuchwa, mukigono kya mwiso.”<verse eid="JHN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu akamlongie, “Nene ndi yendichulumbucha vanu na kuvagavila uwumi. Yeakundidikila nene ata ngita afua daikwikala kangi. <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />Na munu yoyonda yeikwikala na kundidikila, seafua mbepali. Wuli, veve ukugaidikila aga?”<verse eid="JHN 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita akamlongie, “Ndakyene Mtwa! Nene ndidikila kuva veve ndi Kilisito, Mwana va Nguluvi, yula yeachile ku inyi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivemba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Malita peamalile kulonga ago, akahelela kumkemela Malia muhacha vake, akamlongie pono pahela vanu, “Muwulanichi agehe baha, akukukemela.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Malia peapulike ago, akaimile kisatu, akamuhelelie Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu akali seingiye ku kijiji, ila akali pono pala Malita peamwanuke. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Vala Vayawudi vevakali ku kaye pamwi na Malia vakimnamacha, pevamuwonile ikwima na kuhuma kwivala, vakamfwatile kuno vahocha iyelela mumgunda va Nguluvi kuvembela ukoya.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Malia peafikile pono pala peakali Yesu, akafugamile na kulonga, “Mtwa, ngita ngauvechile baha, maama vangu ngeseafuwa!”<verse eid="JHN 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu peamuwene ivemba na vala Vayawudi vevakali pamwi nave vivemba, akasugwime hilo na akali na lihingili munumbula lyake. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Baho akavahucha, “Mumvikile kwii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">Vakamlongie, “Mtwa, wache upalole.”<verse eid="JHN 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu akavembile. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Baho Vayawudi vakalonga, “Mulole njawo peakamkela Lasalo!”<verse eid="JHN 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Ila vamonga vakalongile, “Wuli, munu uyu se nde yeamdinduwe meho yula munu yeabofwike meho, seawesile kumgita Lasalo abihile kufua?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ekumchulubucha Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu akiva ave asugwime hilo, akahelele mumgunda va Nguluvi. Likabuli lyene likali manga na likali ligubwike kwa liganga likomi. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu akalonga, muheche liganga ilyo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Malita muhacha va Lasalo, akamlongie, “Mtwa, avangile kunung'a, kwakuva chichumbile figono fitayi kuhuma peavikilwe mulikabuli!”<verse eid="JHN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu akamlongie, “Wuli, Sendikulongile kuva ukidikila daukuulola ukomi va Nguluvi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Ndeni, vakalihechile lila liganga. Yesu akalolile kukyanya kwa Nguluvi, akalonga, “Ndikuhongecha Daada kwakuva veve ukupulika kusuka kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Ndichela kuva ukundipulika figono fyonda. Ila ndilongile aga kwakuva lya lipinga ili lya vanu vevagehe baha neke vapatile kudikila kuva veve nde yeundilagiliche.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago, akakemela kwa lichwi, “Lasalo, hume kwivala!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Yula yeakali afue akahumile kwaivala, kuno ahingilichiwe ligubiko na mawoko gyake na magulu gyake gawopilwe ndegei cha ligubikilo na wuso vake ugubikwe na litambala. Yesu akavalongie, “Mumwopole, mumleke ahelele.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vayawudi visaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matayo 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Baho Vayawudi volofu vevakali vafikile kwa Malia kumnamacha, pevagawene gala gyeagitile Yesu vakamdikila. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Ila vamonga vawo vakahelela kwa Mafwalisayo na kuvalongela makani gyeagitile Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Ndeni, Vatekechi vakomi na Mafwalisayo vakavakemela filongochi va lidamwa likomi lya Vayawudi, vakihuchine vakilonga, “Tugite liki? Munu uyu igita umanyitu wolofu hilo.<figure style="fig" file="18 Priest.jpg" size="col" ref="11.47">Mtekechi Vakiyawudi</figure> <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ngita tukumleka ayendelele vanu voda davakumdikila. Na Valoma davakwacha na kuhananga Kaye lya Nguluvi vetu na kuvadocha vanu va inyi lyetu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Baho, yumwi vawo yeakameliwe Kayafa, yeakali Mtekechi Mkomi mwaka ugo, akavalongie, “Nyenye semchela kinu! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Wuli, semulola kuva ndi ngiba kwa nyenye munu yumwi afuwe kwakuva lya vanu, kuchumba vanu vonda va inyi yonda iyanang'we?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Mwene seakalongile endena kwakukela mwene, ila kwakuva mwene akali mtekechi mkomi mwaka ugo, akalague kuva Yesu daifua kwakuva lya vanu va ku inyi lya Vayawudi, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />sekwakuva lya Vayawudi veka hela, ila avalete pamwi vana va Nguluvi vevayaganile.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Kuhuma kigono ikyo filongochi va Vayawudi vakasakile ng'asi lya kumdocha Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Ndena, Yesu akali igenda kya kwifiya mu kijiji kya Yudea, ila akahegile pala, akahelela pono pepi na kuwelu, mukijiji Efulamu. Akakalile ukoya pamwi na vachulila vake.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Lihungu lya Vayawudi lya Pasaka likali pepi, vanu volofu vakahumile mu mwani chawo na vakahelela ku Yelusalemu peyave Pasaka neke vadikilwe pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ndeni, vanu vakali vakumsaka Yesu, vene pevilundise pamwi ku Kaye lya Nguluvi, vihuchine, “Nyenye mwihocha liki? Yiwoneka munu uyu seikwacha mulihungu ilyi?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Vatekechi vakomi na Mafalisayo valagiliche kuva munu yeyonda yeichela peagehe Yesu avalongie neke vene vahelele vambatile Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu isukulilwa manung'unilo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matayo 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14.3-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Figono sita kabula lya lihungu lya Pasaka likali have, Yesu akafikile Betania yeakwikala Lasalo yeachulubuchwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Ukoya vakamwandilisie kyakula kwa uginyo lya Yesu. Malita akali akuvahudumila. Lasalo akali yumwi va vala yevali pamwi na Yesu pamesa lya kyakulia. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Malia akanyamule libochobocho lya mafuta ga manung'unilo gya nalido gyegagelanichwe kwa sendi ngomi akambakile Yesu mumagulu gyake na kufyangusa kwa fwili chake. Kaye yonda ikanung'unile mafuta gala. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Yuda Sikaliyoti, yumwi va vachulila va Yesu, pambele ekumkana Yesu, akalonga, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Manung'ulilo ago ngagaguchilwe ngatupatile sendi na kuvagavila vahangala, ngatuwesile kupata sendi cha kumuhomba munu mahombo gyake gya mwaka?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Yuda alongile ago, sekuvawonela lusungu vahangala, ila akali mwichi kwakuva mwene akali mvika lusanja na figono fyolofu akali ihicha mumula mulusanja na kutumila weka hela. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Ila Yesu akahiga, mumleke maye uyu! Andisukulie mafuta kwakuva lya kigono kyangu kya kusilwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Kwakuva vahangala muvecha navo figono fyonda, ila semvecha na nene figono fyonda.<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vilongosi va Vayawudi visaka ng'asi lya kumdocha Lasalo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Vayawudi volofu vakapulike kuva Yesu agehe ku Betania. Vakahelela ukoya sekumlola Yesu hela, ila kumlola Lasalo yeachulubichwe na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Vatekechi vakomi vakagitile mpango va kumdocha Lasalo, <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwakuva lya Lasalo Vayawudi volofu vakavalema filongosi vawo, vakamdikila Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ikwingila ku Yelusalemu kwa kulumbilila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matayo 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19.28-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Pamilau lyake, lipinga likomi lya vanu vevachile mulihungu vakapulike kuva Yesu agehe kung'asi ikwacha ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Vakakolile mikwati gya mitende vakahuma vakahelela kumwanuka, kuno vilonga, “Tumdikile Nguluvi! Anemelwe uyu yeikwacha kwa umwimike va Mtwa. Anemelwe ng'achale va Isilaeli.”<verse eid="JHN 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu akamwene mwanapunda akamkang'iye, ngita peisimbilwe Mumasimbo,<verse eid="JHN 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />“Bihile kwogopa vanu va mwani va Siyuni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">Lole ng'achale venu ikwacha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:15">akang'iye mwanapunda!”<verse eid="JHN 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Chipindi icho vachulila vake sevachile makani ago, ila Yesu achulubuke suwe, vakawiwuke kuva ago gakali gasimbilwe kutigila mwene na kuva vanu vamgitile ago.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Lipinga lya vanu likali pamwi na Yesu chipindi peamkemelige Lasalo kuhuma mumgunda lya Nguluvi na kumchulubucha kuhuma kwa vanu yevafue, vakalutiche makani gya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Lipinga lila lya vanu vakahelela kumwanuka, kwakuva vampulike kuva Yesu agitile umanyitu ugo va kumchulubucha Lasalo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Mafwalisayo vakalonganile, “Mulola? Setuwesa kugita kyekyonda! Mlole vanu vonda vakumdikila mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vagiliki vamonga vakela kumlola Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kukali na vamonga va Vagiliki mugati mwa vanu vafikile ku Yelusalemu kumfunya Nguluvi chipindi cha lihungu lya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Vanu avo vamuheleliye Filipo, munu va Betisaida muinyi Galilaya, vakamlongie. “Mkomi, tukela kumlola Yesu.”<verse eid="JHN 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo akahelela, akamlongie Andelea, baho avo vavili vakahelela kumlongela Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu akavalongie, “Chipindi cha kunjumwa kwa Mwana va Munu ifikile! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mbeyu lya ngano peseiguwa muganga na kufua, isigala ngita mbeyu weka hela. Ila leke ifue ibaba manunu myolofu. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Munu yeyonda yeikela uwumi vake, akuwuyagicha na yula yeivipila uwumi vake muinyi ugu akugalowola ata uwumi va mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Munu yeyonda yeisaka kundigumbanikila nene ndi ing'ang'wa andifuatile neke mnyigendwa vangu aveche na nene kila pono. Munu yeyonda yeakumgumbanikila Daada vangu igavilwa uginyange.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga kufua kwa mwene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Nondee numbula lyangu isugwime hilo na ndilonge liki? Ndilonge, ‘Daada, ndikusuka undilowole chipindi cha magudo?’ Hamu, sendiwesa kusuka ngita ndeni, kwakuva ndachile neke ndichumbile mumagudo ngita indena. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Daada, linjumwe litawa lyako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Baho lichwi ikapulikwe kuhuma kukyanya kwa Nguluvi, “Ndilinjumile suwe na ndikulinjuma kangi.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Lipinga lya vanu vevakali vahimile baho vakapulike lichwi ilyo na vamunga vawo vakalonga, “Ndimdilimo.” Ila vangi vakalonga, “Vandumindumi va Nguluvi aywangile na mwene!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Ila Yesu akavalongie, “Lichwi iyi seipulikike kwakuva lya nene, ila kwakuva lya nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Nondee ndi chipindi cha Nguluvi kuvahiga vanu va inyi. Nondee chipindi cha Nguluvi kumdaga kwivala Setani ndi mkomi va inyi iyi. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Na nene pandinamuliwa kukyanya kwa Nguluvi kuhuma ku inyi, ndikuvakwega vanu vonda kwa nene.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu alongile ago akawonise ifua wuli.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Lila lipinga lya vanu likamuhigile, “Nefwe tupulike kuhuma mumasimbo gyetu kuva Kilisito yeahaguliwe na Nguluvi ekwikala mbepali. Veve uwesa wuli kulonga, Mwana va Munu isakwa kunamuliwa muinyi? Uyo Mwana va Munu ndi ani?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu akavalongie, “Welu uvecha na nyenye kwa chipindi chidodo. Mugende muwelu neke kisi libihile kuvagubika, kwakuva yeagenda mukisi seachela kweihelela. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Suwe, chipindi mgehe na ugo welu muuwidikile neke mpatile kuva vanu va welu.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Vanu vahela udikilo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Pamalile kulonga malichwi ago, Yesu akahelile sake na kwifyama kutali na lipinga lila.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Ata ngita, Yesu agitile umanyitu gyonda kuno valolela, ila vene sevamdikila, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />ndena, njowo chealongile mvichi Isaya giwonike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">“Mtwa, ndi ani yeadikile unanzi vake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:38">Mtwa amwonesile ani umwimike vake?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Sevawesile kudikila Yesu, kwakuva Nguluvi alongile kuchumbila mvichi Isaya kuva,<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />“Nguluvi agagitile meho gabihile kulola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">kuchubugacha luhala chawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">neke sevawesile kulola kwa meho gyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">vala kuchela kwa luhalwa lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">neke vabihile kuwuya kwa nene, alongile Mtwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">neke vabihile kunana.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Mvichi Isaya akalongile ago kwakuva akauwene ukomi va Yesu, kulonga makani gyake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ata ndeni, filongosi vangi va Vayawudi vamdikile Yesu. Ila sevakalongile pawelu kuva vaidikile, kwakuva lya kuvakogopa Mafalisayo kuvadaga mu Kaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Filongochi avo Vayawudi vakakeliye hilo kuginywa na vanu, kuchumba kuginywa na Nguluvi.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu achile kuvalowola vanu va inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Baho Yesu akalongile kwa lichwi likomi, Munu yeanidikila nene, akundidikila nene hela, seadikila nene hela, akumdikila na yula yeandilagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Yeandilolela nene akumlolela na yula yeandilagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nene ndi welu, na nene ndachile ku inyi neke vonda yevakundidikila vabihile kusigalia mukisi. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Yepulika malichwi gyangu ila seikolela, nene semuhiga, kwakuva sendachile kuhiga inyi ila kuvalowa. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Munuyeyonde yeseakupulika malichwi gyangu namwene daihigwa kwa malichwi gya undakyene gye ndikagalongiye. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nene sendilongile kwa kukela nene yune, ila Daada yeandilagiliche ndi yeandiswitiliche ndilonge liki na ndiywange liki. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Na nene ndichela kuva ulagicho lwake luletila uwumi va mbepali. Nene ndilonga gala hela gealagileche Daada ndigalonge.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ekuvakalavicha vachulila vake magulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Kisigalie kigono kimwi kya lihungu lya Pasaka. Yesu akachelie kuva chipindi chake kikali kifikile kya kuhega ku inyi na kuhelela kwa Daada. Avakeliye vanu vake muinyi figono fyonda, avakeliye hilo ngajila mwiso!<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Yesu pamwi na vachulila vake vakali kuliya kyakula kya palumiemie. Setani akaingile mugati lya numbula lya Yuda Isikalioti, mwana va Simoni Isikalioti, natilo amseduke Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu akachelie kuva Daada avikile kila kinu kufilongocha, kangi akali ahumile kwa Nguluvi na ewuya kangi kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Yesu akahegile pamesa, akafulile mwenda vake va kwivala, akategula kitambala na kwiwopa pakigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Baho akavika malenga mulibakuli, akavanga kuvaogofecha vachulila vake mumagulu na kuifyangula na kitambala kyeawopile pakigudi. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Peafikile peakali Simoni Peteli, Peteli akamlongile, “Mtwa, veve usaka kundiwogofecha magulu nene?”<verse eid="JHN 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu akamhigile, “Seuwesa kuchela kyendigitila nondee, ila wichela pambele.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Peteli akamlongie, “Veve seuwesa kuniogoficha nene magulu ha!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Yesu akamhigile, “Ngita sendikukwogofecha veve daseuvecha na nene kangi.”<verse eid="JHN 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Peteli akamhigile, “Mtwa, ndiogofiche semagulu hela, ila na mawoko gyangu na lituwe!”<verse eid="JHN 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu akamlongie, “Munu yeogile suwe seing'ang'wa kwoga kangi ila ewesa kukalava magulu hela, kwakuva mvili vake vonda ndi mnofu. Nyenye ndi vanofu ila sekila yumwi venu.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />Yesu akamchele ndi ani yeakumkana, nde kwakuva Yesu akalongile, “Nyenye ndi vanofu ila sekila yumwi venu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Peasindile kuvawogoficha magulu, akafwalile kangi mwenda gyake, akawuyile kwikala pamesa pono pake, akavahucha, “Muchele gyendivagitile? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Nyenye munikemela Muwulanichi na Mtwa, nyenye mwilonga unofu, kwakuva ndi yune. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Nene Mtwa na Muwulanichi venu ndivawogofiche nyenye magulu na nyenye mwing'ang'wa mwihogofeche magulu. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ndivagavie mufano, neke na nyenye mugite ngita pendivagitie nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, mnjagila semkomi kuchumba mtwa vake, vala mnjangila semkomi kuchumba yula yeamlagiliche. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Ngita mugachele ago, suwe, Nguluvi daavafunya ngita damugita.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Aga gyendilongile se gyenu vonda, nene ndikuvachela vala ndivandiaguwe. Ila ging'ang'wa Masimbo ga Nguluvi gaveche, ngita pegilonga, ‘Yula yealiye kyakula pamwi na nene nde yeakunikana.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nene ndivalongie makani aga salaisi pegavekuhumila, neke pegihumila muwese kudikila kuva, ‘Nene nde Yune.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, yeakumwanuka yula yeandilagiche akunimwanuka nene, yeakuniwanuka nene, akumwanuka yula yeandilagiche.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga kuva ikanwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Matayo 26.20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Maliko 14.17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luka 22.21-23</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago, numbula ikasugwime hilo, akalongile pawelu, “Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, yumwi venu ekunikanila!”<verse eid="JHN 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Vachulila viloline sevakachele kuva Yesu akumlongela ani. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yumwi va vachulila, yeakali ikelwa hilo na Yesu, akali akalile pepi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Suwe, Simoni Peteli akamkonyesile muyage kuno ilonga, “Muwuche akumlonga ani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Mchulila yula akahegeliye pepi na Yesu, akamuhucha, “Mtwa, ndi ani?”<verse eid="JHN 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu akahigile, “Yula yendikumgavila kipande kya libubunda nde mwene.” Baho akategule kipande kya libumunda akachwikile mulibakuli, akamgavila Yuda, mwana va Simoni Sikaliyoti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda peawanuke kipande ikyo, baho Setani akamwingile. Suwe, Yesu akamlongie, “Kyeukela kugita, gite kisatu!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Ila kuhela munu ata yumwi yeakalile pamesa yeachelile wuli akamlongiye ndena. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwakuva Yuda akali mvika lusanja, vamonga vawo vakacheliye kuva Yesu amlongile agule finu fya lihungu awu vacheliye amlongie akaheche kyekyonda kwa vahangala.<verse eid="JHN 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Suwe, Yuda akawanuke kila kipande kya libumunda, baho akahumile kwivala. Ikali pamie.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lulagilicho Limiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Yuda peahegile, Yesu akalongile, nondee ukomi vangu nene Mwana va Munu ugehe pepi kuwoneka pawelu. Kangi dauwoneka pawelu ukomi va Nguluvi kuchumbila mumagito gyangu. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Mwana daakuvawonesa vanu Nguluvi peagehe mkomi, baho Nguluvi daakumnyamula Mwana na kuvawonesa vanu Mwana peagehe mkomi. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Vana vangu, ava ndigehe na nyenye kwa chipindi chidodo hela. Mukunisaka, ila nondee ndikuvalongela gala gyendivalongele vakomi va Vayawudi, ‘Kwendihelela nyenye semuwesa kuhelela!’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Ndikuvagavila lulagicho lumiya, muyikela ngita pendivakeliye nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Pemukwikela, vanu vonda vichela kuva nyenye ndi vachulila vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga kuva Peteli akumkana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matayo 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22.31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Peteli akamuhucha, “Mtwa, wihelela kwii?” Yesu akamhigile, “Kwendihelela seuwesa kunifwatila nondee, ila ukunifuatila pambele.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Peteli akamlongie, “Mtwa, kwa liki sendiwesa kukufwatila nondee? Nene dandifuwa kwakuva lya veve.” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu, akahigile, Ndakyene veve wifuwa kwa kuva lya nene? Ndakyene ndikulongela, livisi pelyave selivika uvecha unikanile mala chidatu!<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi ng'asi lya kuheleliya kwa Daada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu akavalongela, “Mbihile kuswigima munumbula chenu. Mumdikile Nguluvi na mundidikile na nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Mukaye lya Daada vangu muna fyumba fyolofu, ngita sevesile endena, ngandivalongiye daha. Ndihelela kuvandalisia pakwikala. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Pendisinda kuandalisa pakwikala, dandiwuya kangi kuvategula, neke pandivecha nene na nyene muveche baho. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Na nene kwinihelela muyichele ng'asi.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi akamuhuchile, “Mtwa, setuchela wihelela kwii, tuwesa wuli kuichela ilyo ng'asi?”<verse eid="JHN 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu akamhigile, “Nene ndi ng'asi na undakyene na uwumi. Kuhela munu yeiwesa kuhelela kwa Daada ngajila kuchumbila kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Ngita mukunichela nene, mukumchela na Daada vangu. Kuvangila neng'uni mukumchela na mumwene suwe.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo akamlongie, “Mtwa, nefwe tukela utuwonise Daada hela, suwe!”<verse eid="JHN 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu akamlongie, ndikalile na nyenye figono fyolofu, Filipo wilonga seundichela? Yeaniwonile suwe nene amuwonile Daada. Wuli mwilonga, ndivawonese Daada? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Wuli, veve seudikila kuva nene ndigehe mugati lya Daada na Daada agehe mugati lyangu? Njowo chendivalongie sendilonga kwa umwimike vangu, ila Daada yeali mugati lyangu igita kasi lyake. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mwing'ang'wa kundidikila pendilonga kuva nene ndigehe mugati lya Daada na mwene Daada agehe mugati lyangu. Ngita semukunidila nene, mudikile kwakuva makani gyendigitila. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Ndakyene ndikuvalongela, yeakundidila nene, igita makani gala gyendigita nene, daigita makomi kuchumba aga, kwakuva nene ndihelela kwa Daada. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na kyokyonda kyemkusuka kwa umwimike vangu ndigita, neke Mwana avawonese vanu Nguluvi peagehe mkomi. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Pemukundisuka kyokyonda kwa umwimike vangu, nene ndikuvagitila.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga akuvaletela Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />Ngita mukunikele damukolela malagicho gyangu. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Na nene ndikumsuka Daada, mwene akuvagavila Mtanga yungi, yeakwikala na nyenye mbepali. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Muhe uyu dakuvagubutulila vanu undakyene. Vanu va inyi sevavesa kumwanuka kwakuva sevavesa kumulola vala kumchela. Ila nyenye mumchela kwakuva isigala na nyenye na ivecha mugati yenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Sendikuvaleka nyenye vakiva, ndikwacha kangi kwa nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Kisigaliye chipindi chidodo vanu va kuinyi sevakunilola kangi, ila na nyenye damukundilola, kwakuva nene ndivecha uwumi na nyenye damuvecha uwumi. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Kigono kila pekifika muchela kuva nene ndigehe mugati lya Daada na nyenye mugehe mugati lyangu, nene ndigehe mugati lyenu.<verse eid="JHN 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Yeawanuka lulagicho lwangu na kuchikolela, uyu nde akunikela. Mwene yeakunikela nene na Daada vangu dakumkela, nene ndikumkela na kwiwonesa kwa mwene.<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda seyula Sikaliyoti akamlongie, “Mtwa, ivecha wuli veve kutugita tukuchele na sevanu va inyi vesekudikila veve vakuchele?”<verse eid="JHN 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu akahigile, munu yeandikela nene ekolela luchowo lyangu na Daada vangu ekumkela na nefwe datukwacha kwa mwene na tukwikala na mwene. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Yeseakunikela nene sevikolela njowo changu. Na luchowo lyemulipulike se lya nene, ila ndi lya Daada yeanilagiliche.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Ndivalongie njowo ichi pendigehe ndave pamwi na nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />Ila Mtanga uyo, ndi Muhe va Nguluvi, yealagichwa na Daada kwa umwimike vangu, ekuvawulanicha kila kinu na kuvawuwisa gonda gyendivalongie.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />Ndikuvalekela ulutengamaso, ndi lutengamaso lyelihuma kwa nene. Selutengamaso ngita yila yeihuma kwa vanu va muinyi ndena mbihile kugudika munumbula chenu kangi mbihile kwogofya kinu kyokyonda. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mukanipulikile suwe pandivalongie, ndihelela, pambele ndiwuya kangi kwa nyenye. Ngita ngamunikela, ngamwikeduka kwakuva ndihelela kwa Daada, kwakuva mwene ndi mkomi kuchumba nene. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Ndivalongie aga nondee ave kuhumila, neke pegihumila mpatile kudikila. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Sendilongela kangi makani myolofu, kwakuva mtavala va inyi iyi ikwacha, ila mwene kwa nene ihela umwimike. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Ila vanu va inyi vachele kuva ndikumkela Daada na ndigita finu fyonda ngita Daada anilagichile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">Mwime, tuhege baha!<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndi msabibu va undakyene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />Yesu akalongie, “Nene ndi msabibu va undakyene na Daada vangu nde mgima. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Mwene edumula kila likwati lyeselibaba manunu na kila likwati lyelibaba akulihengelela neke libabe manunu myolofu. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Nyenye muveche suwe vanofu kwakuva lya wula unanzi wendivalongie. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mwikale mugati lyangu na nene ndikale mugati lyenu. Ngita ndeni likwati selivesa weka kubaba manunu mbaka liveche mulibiki lya msabibu. Ndena semuwesa kugita kyeakela Nguluvi ngita semukwikala mugati lyangu.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nene ndi msabibu na nyenye ndi makwati. Yeakwikala mugati lyangu na nene ndikala mugati lyake, mwene ibaba manunu gyolofu, kwakuva ngajila nene semvesa kugita kyokyonda. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Munu yeyonda yeseakwikala mugati lyangu itagwa kwivala ngita likwati pelitagwa kwivala na kugama. Vanu vakulihola likwati lya indena na kulitaga mulyoto lipie. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mukikala mugati lyangu na malichwi gyangu ngagakwikala mugati lyenu, msuke kyokyonda kyemkela na nyenye damwigavilwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Vanu davachela Daada vangu peagehe mkomi, kwa kugita makani gyegakumkesala Nguluvi na nyenye damwivecha vachulila vangu ndakyene. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nene ndivakelie nyenye ngita ndena Daada peanikelie nene. Mwikale kwa kulongochwa kwa lukelo lwangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Pemukolela malagicho changu na nene dandikwendelela kuvakela mulukelo lwangu, ngita fila nene pendichidikile malagicho ga Daada vangu na ikwendelela kundikela.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Nding'ang'a nyenye munikedukile nene na nene ndiendelele kuvakedukila nyenye ndikwakuva ndivalongie makani aga. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Iyi ndi lulagilicho lwangu, Muyikele nyenye kwa nyenye ngita nene pendivakele nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ng'asi ngomi lya kuvawonesa kuva ukuvakela vaganja vako, ndi kula kufuwa neke vene vikale uwumi. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Ngita mwigita gala gendivalagiliche, nyenye ndi vaganja vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Kuvangila nondee sendikuvakemela kangi vasutu vangu, kwakuva msutu seachela cheagita mtwa vake. Ila nene ndivakemele nyenye vaganja vangu, kwakuva ndivalongiye gyonda gyendilagilichwe na Daada kuhuma kuluhano. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Nyenye semunihaguwe nene, ila nene ndivahaguwe nyenye na kuvalagilicha muhelele mukavelete vangi vandidikile nene na manunu gyenu gya kwikala. Suwe, kyokyonda kyemusuka kwa umwimike vangu, Daada vangu daakuvagavila. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Suwe, ndikuvalagilicha nyenye, mwikele nyenye kwa nyenye.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vanu va inyi sevakuvakela nyenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Ngita vanu va inyi iyi vakuvavipila nyenye, muwiuke kuva valonguwe kunivipila nene. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Ngita na nyenye ngamvechile vanu va inyi iyi, suwe, ngaavakelie na nyenye. Ila ndeni nyenye sevanu va inyi iyi, ila nene ndivahaguwe kuhuma muinyi iyi, nde kwakuva ikuvagita vavavipile nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Muwiuke gendivalongie kuva, ‘Msutu se mkomi kuchumba mtwa vake.’ Suwe, ngita vandigudise nene na nyenye davakuvagudisa, ila ngita vidikila mawulanicho gyangu, suwe, davawesa kudikila mawulanicho gyenu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Ila davakuvagitila ago gyonda kwakuva lya kunidikila nene, kwakuva sevamchela yeanilagilichile nene. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ngita ngasendachile kwa vene na kuvalongela unanzi kuhuma kwa Nguluvi, suwe ngasevagehe na nongwa, ila nondee sevawesa kwitasa kuva vihela nongwa pautalo lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Munu yeyonda yeakunivipila nene, ndenindeni akumvipila na Daada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ndigitile umanyitu mikomi gyesegitilwe na munu yeyonda yula, ngita sengavawonile ngasevavechile na nongwa. Ila nondee vagawonile gyonda gendigitile, ata ndeni wave vakunivipila nene na ndenindeni vakumvipila Daada vangu. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Ila aga gyonda gahumile neke gyegasimbilwe Mumasimbo ga Nguluvi, gawese kuwoneka ga undakyene, ‘Vandivipile hela.’<verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Dandikumlagicha Muhe va Nguluvi, yeihuma kwa Daada na daakuvawonesa undakyene. Muhe uyo akuvatanga nyenye na daavalongela undakyene kutigila nene pendigehe. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Kangi na nyenye damulonga makani gyangu, kwakuva mukali pamwi na nene kuhuma pamwandi.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Ndivalongie ago neke mbihile kuleka kudikila. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Vanu vakuvadaga nyenye mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi, chipindi chikwacha kila yeakuvadocha nyenye daihocha kuva akumgumbanikila Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Vanu davakugita ndena kwakuva sevamchela Daada na vala sevakunichela nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ndivalongie makani aga neke chipindi cha ago pegagita chipindi chifikile muwiwuke kuva ndivalongie.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Kasi lya Muhe va Nguluvi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Dandivalongie makani ago kuhuma pamwandi kuva ndikali na pamwi nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Ila nondee ndikuhelela kwa yula yeandilagiliche na kwihela munu ata yumwi venu yeakundiwucha, ndihelela kwii. <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwakuva ndivalongie makani aga muswigime munumbula chenu. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Ila ndikuvalongela undakyene, ngiba kwa nyenye nene kuhelela, kwakuva pesendihelela Mtanga daseikwacha kwa nyenye. Ila pendihelela, suwe, ndikumlagicha kwa nyenye. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Mwene dapeikwacha akuvalongela ndakyene vanu va inyi kuva vigita nongwa kwa makani ga nongwa, makani gye gakumkelesa Nguluvi na lihiga lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Vigita nongwa kutigila nogwa, kwakuva sevandidikila nene, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />Kutigila makani gekakumkelesa Nguluvi, nene ndigitile gala gegakumkelesa Nguluvi, ndena ndihelela kwa Daada na nyenye dasemukunilola kangi, <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />daakuvawonesa pawelu kuva Nguluvi daavahiga, kwakuva ahigilwe suwe Setani yeagehe mtavala va inyi ugu.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Ndigehe na golofu ga kuvalongela, ila kwa nondee semuwesa kugahuvilila gonda. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Ila dapeikwacha uyo Muhe va undakyene daakuvagita muchele undakyene vonda va Nguluvi, mwene daseilonga kwa umwimike vake yumwene, ila dailonga geakugapulika na kuvalongela dagegakwacha. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Mwene daakuvawonesa pendigehe mkomi kwakuva akuvalongela makani gonda kuhuma kwa nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Fyonda fyeagehenafyo Daada ndi fya nene, nde kwakuva ndilongile kuva uyo Muhe akuvalongela gala gyonda gegihuma kwa nene.<verse eid="JHN 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusugwima na kukeduka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Chisigaliye chipindi chidodo hele na nyenye semunilola na pambele ludodo mkunilola kangi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Baho vamonga va vachulila vake vihuchine, fyeilonga fina mana liki? Ekutulongela fisigale figono fidodo na nyenye semunilola na pambele ludodo mkundilola kangi? Kangi igehe na mana liki peilonga, kwakuva ndihelela kwa Daada. <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Suwe, vakaendelela kwihucha, makani liki aga gyeilonga? Setuchela ilongela liki.<verse eid="JHN 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu akachelie kuva vakasakile kumuhucha, “Suwe, akavalongie, Mwiwuchana fyendilonge, ‘Fisigalile figono fidodo na nyenye semukunilola na pambele ludodo damukunilola kangi?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Ndikuvalongela ndakyene, nyenye mwikola na kudadava, ila vanu va inyi vakeduka, mwilola luswigimo ila luswigimo venu useduka kuva lukeduko. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Ngita mdala peikwelela kubaba mwana usungwima kwa kuva chipindi chake kifikile, ila peibaba suwe isemwa wula utumama kwakuva lya lukeduko lya kupatila mwana vake. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Na nyenye nondee mugehe na lusugwimo, ila ndikwacha kwa nyenye kangi, na nyenye mumema lukeduko munumbula yenu na lukeduko ulo kwihela munu yeihecha kwa nyenye.<verse eid="JHN 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />“Kigono ikyo semukundisuka kyokyonda. Ndikuvalongela undakyene, kyokyonda kyekumsuka Daada kwa umwimike vangu, akuvagavila. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mbaka nondee semusukile kyokyonda kwa umwimike vangu. Musuke na nyenye damuwanuka neke lukeduko hilo.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu auwesile inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Ndivalongie makani aga kwa kwifyama. Ila chipindi kikwacha nene sendiywanga kangi na nyenye kwa kwifyama, ila ndikuvalongela pawelu makani gya Daada. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Kigono ikyo damusuka kwa umwimike vangu na sendikuvalongela kuva ndikuvasuka kwa Daada kwakuva lya nyenye, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />Daada mwene akuvakela nyenye, kwakuva nyenye mukunikela nene na mwidikile kuva nene ndihumile kwa Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nene nihumile kwa Daada, ndikachile muinyi na nondee ndihega muinyi na ndiwuya kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Baho vachulila vake vakamlongie, “Nondee wilonga mwachimwachi, vala seulonga kwa kwifyama. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nondee twichela kuva veve wichela kila kinu na kwehela kwakuva lya munu kukuwucha, nondee twidikila kuva uhumile kwa Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu akavahigila, “Nondee mwidikila? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Chipindi kikwacha, kangi ufikile suwe, mwivonda pemyaganika kila munu mukaye lyake na nene ndisigala weka, ila sendigehe weka hela kwakuva Daada agehe pamwi na nene. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Ndivalongie makani aga neke mpatile kuva na ulutengamaso pemvecha pamwi na nene. Vanu va muinyi mwipatila utumama, ila mugangamale! Nene niuvesile suwe inyi!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvasukila vachulila vake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu peamalile kulonga ago, akalolile pakwanya kwa Nguluvi kuno ilonga, Daada, chila chipindi chifikile! Uvawonese vanu ukomi vako nene mwana vako pendegehe neke Mwana vako awawonese ukomi vako. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Kwakuva umgavile Mwana vako umwimike va kuvalongocha vanu vonda neke avagavile uwumi va mbepali vonda vala veuvagavie. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na uwumi va mbepali ndi ugu, kukuchela veve weka Nguluvi va undakyene na kumchela Yesu Kilisito yeumlagiche. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Nene ndivawonesile vanu vako peugehe mkomi muinyi kuchumbila kasi cheukandilagiche ndichigite. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nondee Daada! Uvawonese vanu pendigehe mkomi kwa wula ukomi wendikali navo pewave seuwumbile inyi.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Ndikugitile uchelwe kwa vanu vala veunigaviye kuhuma kuinyi. Vevakali vako, veve ukandigavie nene, kangi vidikile luchowo lyako. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nondee vachela kuva kila kyeunigavile kihumile kwa veve. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Kwakuva undilongiye gyonda geundilongiye. Vene vakauwanuke, vachela undakyene kuva ndihumile kwa veve na vidikila kuva veve undilagiche.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />Ndivasukila avo, sendikuvasukila vanu va muinyi, ila ndikuvasukila vala veundigavile, kwakuva vene ndi vako. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Vanu vonda vevanene ndi va veve, kangi vanu vevaveve ndi va nene. Ukomi uwonikanike kuchumbila avo veundigavile. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Nene ndikwacha kwa veve, sendigehe kangi kuinyi, ila vene davikwendelela kusigala kuinyi. Daada Nguluvi! Uvadime vanu kwa umwimike vangu weundigavile, neke vonda vave pamwi ngita nefwe tugehe pamwi. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Pendigehe na vene, nene ndivadimile na kuvavika panofu kwa umwimike vangu weunigavile. Kwihela ata yumwi yeayagile, ila yumwi hela yula yeahaguliwe neke Masimbo gahumile ndakyene.<verse eid="JHN 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Nondee, ndikwacha kwa veve na makani aga ndilongile chipindi ndigehe ndave muinyi, neke vavecha na ludikilo hilo ngita pendigehe nene na ludikilo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nene ndivagavile unanzi vako na vanu va muinyi vakavavipila, ila vene vevakudikiye se sevanu va muinyi inyi ngita nene sevamuinyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nene sendisukila uvaheche muinyi, ila ndikusuka uvadime na yula mwofu. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Vene seva kuinyi, ngita ndena nene seva kuinyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Daada, ndikusuka uvagite vanu vako hilo kwa kulichela luchowo lyako, kwakuva luchowo lyako ndi undakyene. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Ngita ndeni peundilagiche muinyi na nene ndivalagiche vene muinyi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />Ndikwihecha kukugumbanikila veve kwakuva lya vene, neke vene vivike kwa veve neke vakugumbanikile muundakyene.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Sendivasukila vene weka hela, ila ndikuvasukila vonda yevakudikila kuhumila na unanzi vako. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Ndisuka neke vonda vaveche pamwi ngita veve ugehe mugati lyangu na nene ndigehe mugati lyako. Na vene vave mugati lya veve, neke inyi uvese kudikila kuva veve undilagiche. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nene ndivagavile ukomi wuwula weundigavilege nene, neke vaveche pamwi ngita veve peugehe pamwi na nene. <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />Nene ndiveche mugati lyawo na veve uveche mugati lyangu, ndikusuka vaveche pamwi ndakyene, neke inyi iwese kuchela kuva veve undilagiliche na kuva ukuvakela vawo ngita ukunikela nene.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Daada! Vala veundigavile ndisaka vaveche pamwi na nene pala pendivecha, neke valole ukomi vangu weundigavile, kwakuva undikele inyi peyave seiwumbile. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Daada msanzi! Inyi seyikukuchela, ila nene ndikukuchela na vene vachela kuva veve undilagiche. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Ndikugite uchelwe kwa vene na ndiendelile kugita ndena, neke lukelo weugehe kwanene uveche mugati lyangu na nene ndiveche mugati lyawo.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ibatwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matayo 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22.47-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu peamalile kusuka, akahegile na vachulila vake vakahelela kumwambo lya mgoka Kediloni. Pono pala kukali na mgunda mdodo, Yesu akahingile mula pamwi na vachulila vake. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda, yeamkanile Yesu, kapachela pala, Yesu akali achovie kutang'anilaga na vachulila vake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Yuda akahelela kunyamula lipinga lya vapunga, pamwi na vadima kuhuma kwa vatekechi vakomi na Vafalisayo, kuno vategule kibatali na milwenge pamwi na kyalukilo. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu akachelege fyonda fyefikumuhumila, akahumile pautalo lyawo, akavahucha, “Mukumsaka ani?”<verse eid="JHN 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Vene vakamuhigile, “Yesu Mnazaleti!” Yesu akavalongie.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">“Nene nde.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">Yuda yeamkumkana akali ihimile baho pamwin na vene. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Suwe, Yesu pevalongie, “Ndi nene.” Vene vakawuyile kumbele, vakaguwe panyi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu akavahucha kangi, “Mukumsaka ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">Vakamuhigile tukumsaka, “Yesu Mnasaleti!”<verse eid="JHN 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu akavalongie, “Ndivalongie suwe kuva ndi nene. Ngita mukundisaka nene, muvaleke vanu ava vahele.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Yesu akalongie ndena neke gahumila gala gyealongile pamwandi, “Daada vala veundigavile seayagile ata yumwi.”<verse eid="JHN 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Peteli akahomuwe kimage kikomi kyekidumula kuno na kuno, akamdumule lisigicha lya kulia mnyigendwa va Mtekechi Mkomi. Mnyigendwa yula litawa lyake Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Baho Yesu akamlongie Peteli, “Wise kimage kyako mulihako. Wuli, ndibihile kunyuwa kikombe kya magudo cheandigavile Daada?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isindikwa kwa Mtekechi Mkomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Baho vala vapunga va Valoma na mkomi vao na vadima va Vayawudi vakambata Yesu, vakamuwopa, <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na kumsindika mbaka kwa Anasi, Anasi akali daada mganafu va Kayafa, yulayeakali Mtekechi Mkomi va chipindi ikyo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Uyo Kayafa yeakali avalongie vakomi va Vayawudi kuva ing'ang'wa munu yumwi afue kwakuva lya vonda.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli akumkana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Matayo 26.69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Maliko 14.66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luka 22.55-57</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Semoni Peteli pamwi na mchulila yungi vakamfuatile Yesu. Yula mchulila yungi akali ichelwa kwa Mtekechi Mkomi, akaingile pamwi na Yesu mulidamwa lwa Mtekechi Mkomi. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Ila Peteli akali ahimile kwaivala, pepi na mlyangilo. Yula mchulila yungi yeakali ichelwa na Mtekechi Mkomi akahumile kwivala kumlongela yula mdala yeakali igita kasi lya kudindula mlyangilo amwingiche Peteli mugati. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Mdala yula va pamlyangilo akamuhucha Peteli “Veve ndi yumwinga va vachulila, va munu yula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">Peteli akamlongie, “Se nene!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Vanyigendwa na vadima vakali vakakochile lyoto kwakuva kukali na ng'ala, vakali vihotola lyoto. Peteli na mwene akali ihota lyoto pamwinga.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtekechi Mkomi akumuhucha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Matayo 26.59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Maliko 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luka 22.66-71</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Mtekechi Mkomi akamuhucha Yesu, makani gya vachulila vake na mawulanichi gyake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu akamhigile, “Nene ndilongile na vanu vonda va muinyi wachiwachi. Figono fyonda ndiwulaniche kukaye lya kufunyila na kukaye lya Nguluvi, pala pono Vayawudi vonda vakwitanganilaga, vala sendilongile kyokyonda kwa kwifyama. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Wuli, ukunihucha nene? Vahuche vanu vevanipulikile nene. Vawo vachela kyendivalongie.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Peamalile kulonga ago mdima yumwi yeakali ahimile pepi na Yesu akamtovile limbalamanda kuno ilonga, “Wuli, ukumhiga endena Mtekechi Mkomi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu akamhugile, “Ngita ndilongie njowo chiwofu, wonese uwofu wene. Ila ngita ndilongie undakyene, wuli ukunitovela?”<verse eid="JHN 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Baho, Anasi akamsindike Yesu kuno awopilwe kwa Kayafa Mtekechi Mkomi.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peteli ilonga seakumchela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Matayo 26.71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Maliko 14.69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luka 22.58-62</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Simoni Peteli akali ahimile ikota lyoto. Vamonga va vala vevagehe bahala vakamuhucha, “Veve ndi yumwi va vala vachulila vake?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Ila Peteli akakanile na kulonga, “Se nene!”<verse eid="JHN 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Mnyigendwa yumwi va Mtekechi Mkomi, mkolo vake yula munu yeadumulwe lisigicha na Peteli, akamuwucha Peteli, “Nene ndikuwonile veve kula mumgunda mdodo pamwi na Yesu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Peteli akakanile kangi, akiliga “Se nene” bahobaho livisi likavikile.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pautalo lya Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Matayo 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Maliko 15.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka 23.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Suwe, kihola sagala, filongochi va Vayawudi vakamtegule Yesu kuhuma kwa Kayafa na kumsindika kaye lya mkomi va Valumi. Ila vene sevakaingie mugati lya kaye vakaongwipe kwingila ukoya ngakuvagitile vabihilwe kumfunya Nguluvi na vabihilwe lihungu lya Pasaka. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Baho kilongosi va Valumi yeakameliwe Pilato akahuma kwivala na kuvahucha, “Wuli munu uyu agitile nongwa liki mbaka mukwacha kumlata kwa nene?”<verse eid="JHN 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Vene vakamuhigile, “Ngita ngaseivecha na nogwa, nefwe ngasetumletile kwa veve.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato akavalongela, “Suwe, mumtegule nyenye mukamuhige kwa malagicho gyenu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Vayawudi vakamuhigile, “Malagicho gyetu katukanila kuhiga kudocha munu yeyonda.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Yikagitilwe ndeni neke makani galongile Yesu chigitilwe kuwonisa kuva ifua wuliwuli.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Baho Pilato akaingile mugati akamkemela Yesu na kumuhucha, “Veve ndi Ng'achale va Vayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Wuli, njowo icho cha veve awu vakulongie vanu vangi njowo changu?”<verse eid="JHN 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato akamuhigile, “Wuli nene ndi Myawudi? Vanu va inyi lyako na Vatekechi vakuletile kwa nene. Ugitile liki?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ung'achale vangu se va inyi ugu, ngita ung'achale vangu ngauvechile va inyi ugu, vanyigendwa vangu ngavanitangile neke ndibihile kubatwa na Vayawudi. Ila nondee ung'achale vangu se va baha.”<verse eid="JHN 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Baho, Pilato akamuhuchile, “Veve ndi Ng'achale?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Yesu akamuhigile, “Veve ulongile nene ndi Ng'achale. Nene ndibabilwe kwakuva iyo na kwajili ilyo ndachile kuinyi, kuvalongela vanu undakyene. Na kila munu va undakyene akunipulikicha nene.”<verse eid="JHN 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato akamuhuchile, “Undakyene ndi kinu liki?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu ihigwa kufua</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Matayo 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Maliko 15.6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23.13-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato peamalile kulonga ago, akavaheleliye kangi Vayawudi kwaivala, akavalongie, “Sendiwonile luchowo lyolyonda lyeagitile munu uyu. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Ila nyenye muchovie kundisuka ndivawopulie munu yumwi kuhuma mukihopo chipindi va lihungu lya Pasaka, nondee mwisaka ndivawopolele Ng'achale va Vayawudi?”<verse eid="JHN 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Baho, vakatovile kyowo, “Hamu, se uyo, tukumkela Balaba!” Ila Balaba akali mnyaga.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Baho, Pilato akaswitiliche Yesu ategulwe, vamtove ndomondo. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Vapuga vakabotile ingela lya mihomi gya miswampondo vakamfwalise Yesu patuwe, kangi vakamfwalise lihingila lya sambalawo lya king'achale, <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />na vakali vikwacha pautalo lyake na kulonga, “Kamwene, Ng'achale va Vayawudi!” Vakamtova mambalamande.<verse eid="JHN 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Baho, Pilato akahumile kwivala kangi, akavalongie, “Mulole, munu uyu ndikumletela kwivala kwa nyenye muchele kuva nene sendiwonile nongwa yeyonda kwa munu uyu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Suwe, Yesu akahuma kwivala, kafwalile ingela lya mihomi na lihingila lya langi lya sambalau. Pilato akavalongie, “Mulole! Munu mwene nde uyu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Vatekechi vakomi pamwi vadima va mukaye lya kutang'anila Vayawudi pevamuwonile Yesu vakalonga kwa lichwi ngomi, “Avambwe pakipindilihicho, avambwe pakipindilihicho!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilato akavalongela, “Mumtegule nyenye baho mumvambe, kwakuva nene sendilionile nongwa lyake.”<verse eid="JHN 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Vayawudi vakamuhigile, “Nefwe tunago malagicho gyetu, kuhumila na malagicho aga, inga'ng'wa kufua, kwakuva akayigita kuva Mwana va Nguluvi.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato peapulikile njowo icho, akagina kwogofya. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Pilato akaingile kangi mukaye lyake, akamuhucha kangi Yesu, “Veve uhumile kwii?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Ila Yesu seamuhigile. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Baho Pilato akamlongie, “Wuli, seukundihiga? Wuli, Seuchela kuva nene ndigehe na umwimike va kukuleka pekesu awu kukuvamba pakindilihicho?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Veve ugehe na umwimike pakyanya lyangu kwakuva ugavile na Nguluvi, ndena yendiletile baha agitile kinu kiwofu hilo.”<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Pilato peapulikile ago akasakile ng'asi lya kumulekela Yesu, Ila Vayawudi vakatovile kyowo, “Ukimlekelela munu uyu, suwe, veve semganja va Kaisali. Kila Munu yeakwigita kuva ng'achale uyo akumpinja Kaisali!”<verse eid="JHN 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilato peapulike njowo icho, akamuhumiche Yesu kwivala na akakalile mukigoda kya kuhiga, pono pepikemilwe, “Pepakilimiwe na kuvikwa kwa Maganga” kwa Kiebulania pakemelwa, “Gabata.” <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Yikali saa sita mukigono kya kuyitayalisa na lihungu lya Pasaka. Pilato akavalongela Vayawudi, “Mulole, Ng'achale venu ndi uyo!”<verse eid="JHN 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Vakalongile kwa lichwi lukomi, “Mdoche! Mdoche! Muvambe mulipindilihicho!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilato akavahucha, “Wuli ndimvambe pakipindilihicho Ng'achale venu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Vatekechi vakomi vakamuhigile, “Nefwe twihela ng'achale yungi ila Ng'achale mkomi va ku Loma weka hela!”<verse eid="JHN 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Baho, Pilato akavagavila Yesu neke vamvambe pakipindilihicho.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ivambwa mulipindilihicho</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matayo 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23.26-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Yesu akahumile kuno atolile lipindilihicho lwake na akahelele pono peikemelwe, “Libang'a lya Lituwe” kwa Kibulania pakemelwa, “Goligota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Chipindi vafikile pala Vakamvambile Yesu palipindilihicho pamwi na vanu vangi vavili, kila mwinga mulipindilihicho lwake, yumwi palubali lwa lyandewo na yungi palubali lya lyanyigi. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato akasimbile mukibawo na akakong'olela pono pa pakyanya palipindilihicho lya Yesu kuva, “Yesu va Nasaleti, Ng'achale va Vayawudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Vayawudi volofu vakakwimbile, kwakuva pono pala pevamkong'olike Yesu palipindilihicho kukali pepi na mwani. Vakasimbile kibawo kila kwa ng'ombelo cha Kibulania, Kilatini na Kigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Suwe, Vatekechi vakomi vakamlongie Pilato, “Ubihile kusimba, ‘Ng'achale va Vayawudi,’ ila usimbe kuva, munu uyu akalongile, ‘Nene ndi Ng'achale va Vayawudi.’”<verse eid="JHN 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato akavahigila, “Gendisimbile, ndisimbile!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Vapuga pevamalile kumvamba Yesu palipindilihicho, vakategule myenda gyake, vakagawine filundo chitai, kila mpuga kilundo kyake. Ila vakategule na lihingila lyake, lihingila ilyo likali libotilwe kuva kinu kimwi kuhuma kukyanya mbaka panyi ngajila kuhonwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Vala vapuga vakwilongela, “Tubihile kuchidemula, ila tutovile gudugudu ivecha lya ani.” Lukani lula likagitilwe neke Masimbilo ga Nguluvi gavecha ndakyene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">“Vakagawine myenda gyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 19:24">na lihingila lyangu vakatovile gudugudu.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Ago gyonda vakagitile vala vapuga.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Pepi na palipindilihicho lwa Yesu vakali vaimile maye va Yesu na maye vake mdodo Yesu na Maliya mdala va Kilopa pamwi na Maliya Magadalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu peamuwonile maye vake na mchulila yeamkelie ahimile pepi maye vake, akamlongela maye vake, “Maye uyo nde mwana vako.”<verse eid="JHN 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Baho, akamlongie yula mchulila, “Uyo nde maye vako.” Kuhuma pala mchulila yula akamtegula maye vake Yesu akahelela nave kukaye lyake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kufuwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matayo 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23.44-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Baho, Yesu akachele amalile kasi chake chonda, neke Masimbo gya Nguluvi gaveche ndakyene, akalonga, “Ndiwona ng'elu.”<verse eid="JHN 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Pala pakali na bakuli yeimemile dafwayi yeihatile, suwe, vakachwike lidodoki mudafwayi, vakavika mulitete na vakamvikiye pamlomo. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu peanyuwe yila dafwayi, akalongile, “Kasi lyangu yisilile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Baho, akagondamicha kituwe kyake, akafuwe.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ihomwa mgoha mulubafu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Baho, vakomi va Vayawudi vakamsukile Pilato avaleke vakadenya magulu gya vala vevambilwe mulipindilihicho na kukwisa mivili gyawo. Vakagita ndeni kwakuva ikali kigono kya mayandaliso lya Kigono kya Kutulula na sevakasakile mivili gya vanu gisigale kukyanya palipindilihicho mu Kigono kya Kutulula, kwakuva kigono ikyo kikali kikomi hilo kwa Vayawudi. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Vapuga vakahelela na vakadenya magulu gya yula munu va kwanja na yula va uvili vevakali vavambilwe pamwi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Ila pevahelele kwa Yesu vakamuwene afuwe suwe, ndeni, sevakamdenyile magulu gyake. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Mpuga yumwi akamdukufule na mgoha mulubafu, bahobaho chikahumile danda na malenga. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Yula yeawonile chechigitilwe pala akavalongie vanu, neke nyenye mdikile. Na ago gyealongile ndi undakyene na kangi mwene ichela kuva ilonga ndakyene. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Lukani ulo likagitilwe neke Masimbo ga Nguluvi gaveche ndakyene, “Kwihela ata lichege lyake daudenywa.” <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Na kangi Masimbo gangi gilonga, “Davikwacha kumlola yula vevamtobuwe.”<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu isilwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matayo 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23.50-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Pegachumbile ago, Yosefu yeahumile mwani va Alimataya, yeakali mchulila va Yesu, ila kwa lupwepo kwakuva akali akuvagogwipa vakomi va Vayawudi, akamweleliye Pilato na kumsuka kuva ndiwesa kutegula mvili va Yesu, Pilato akamuhigile wiwesa kutegula, Yosefu akahelela, akauhecha mvili va Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Yosefu akahelela pamwi na Nikodemu, yula yeahelelie kwa Yesu pamie, akaletile manemane na manung'unilo ukali na usito va kilo selasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Suwe, vavu avo vavili Nikodemu na Yosefu, vakautegula mvili va Yesu, vakaunyengeleta ligubiko na kuubaka gala manung'unilo ngita pevachoviye Vayawudi pevasila. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Pono pala pevamvambile Yesu kukali na mgunda mdodo na mugati, mumgunda mdodo kukali nalikabuli miya lyelihongilwe paligaga lyelikali sevamsilile munu yoyonda. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwakuva ikali kigono kya Vayawudi lya mayandaliso ga Kigono kya Kutulula na kwa kuva lila likabuli lyelihongilwe paliganga likali pepi, vakauvika mvili va Yesu mumo.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Kuchulubuka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matayo 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Maliko 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24.1-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Nyola sagala Kigono kya Kutulula, Maliya va kuhuma Magadala akahelela palikabuli lyelihongwile paliganga na akaliwene lila liganga lihechilwe kumlyangilo mu kukaye lya Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Akanyilile mbaka kwa Peteli na yula mchulila yungi yeakeliwe na Yesu, akamlongie, “Vamuhechile Mtwa mukaye lya Nguluvi na vala setuchela pevemvikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Bahobaho, Peteli na yula mchulila yungi vakahelela kulikabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Vonda vavili vakanyilile ila yula muchulila yungi anyilile kuchumba Peteli, akalongole kufikila pa likabuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Peagundamile na kung'omelela mugati lya likabuli, akawene ligubiko, ila seaingile mugati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Baho akachile Simoni Peteli, akaingile mulikabuli lyelihongwile paliganga, mula akawene ligubiko, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na kila kitambala kyehopwilwe Yesu mutuwe. Kitambala ikyo sekivikilwe pamwi na ligubiko, ila kikali kibandilwe na kuvikwa pono paweka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Baho yula mchulila yungi yealonguwe kufikila palikabuli, akaingile na mwene mugati, akawene na kudikila. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />Vakali wave sevachela Masimbo ga Nguluvi galongile kuva ing'ang'wa achulubuke kuhuma kwa vanu vevafuwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Baho vachulila vakawuya kukaye.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akumuhumila Maliya va ku Magidala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Matayo 28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Maliko 16.9-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Maliya akali ahimile kwivala lya likabuli kuno ave ivemba, akagundamile na kung'omelela palikabuli, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />akavawene vandumindumi va Nguluvi vavili vevafwalile myenda mvalafu hilo, vakalile bahala pamvili va Yesu peukali uvikile, yumwi kumtuwe na yungi kumagulu. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Avo vandumindumi va Nguluvi vakamuhucha, “Maye, wuli uvemba?” Akavahigile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">“Vamuhechile Mtwa vangu na sendichela pevemvikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Baho akasedukile kumbele, akamwene Yesu ahimile bahala, ila seachele kuva yula ndi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu akamuhucha, “Maye, wuli wivemba? Ukumsaka ani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Maliya acheliye yula yeilonga ndi mdima va mgunda mdodo, akamlongela, “Mtwa, ngita veve umuhechile, nilongele kuhumuvikile na nene ndikumtegula.”<verse eid="JHN 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu akamlongela, “Maliya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Maliya akaseduke, akamlongela kwa kibulania, “Laboni” Mana lyake, “Muwulanicha.”<verse eid="JHN 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu akamlongie, “Ubihile kunikolela, kwakuva ndave sendihele kwa Daada. Ila helele kwa lukololo vangu ukavalongele, ndihelela kwa Daada vangu na Daada venu, Nguluvi vangu na Nguluvi venu.”<verse eid="JHN 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Baho Maliya va ku Magidala akahelela kuvalongela vachulila va Yesu akilonga, “Ndimuwene Mtwa!” Na kuvalongela gala gealongilwe na Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vachulila vake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matayo 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maliko 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24.36-49</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Yikali palumiemie lya kigono kya Kutulula na vachulila vakali vatanganile pamwi mugati lya kaye na myangilo gidindilwe kwakuva vavawogwipe vakomi va Vayawudi. Yesu akaachile, akahimile mugati lyawo, akavalongela, “Lutengamaso iveche na nyenye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Peamalile kulonga ago, akavawonesile mawoko gyake na lubafu lwake. Vachulila vakakedukile hilo kumlola Mtwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu akavalongela kangi, “Lutengamaso iveche na Nyenye! Ngita ndeni Daada peandilagiliche nene na nene ndikuvalagilicha nyenye.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Peamalile kulonga ago, akavapumulile muhe na kuvalongela, muwanuke Muhe va Nguluvi. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Ngita mkivahechela vanu nongwa chawo, Nguluvi daakuvahechela, ngita semukuvahechela nongwa chawo, Nguluvi daseakuhechelwa.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi, yumwi va vala kumi na vavili, yeakemelwa Pacha, seakali pamwi chipindi Yesu peachile. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Suwe, vala vachulila vangi vakamlongela, “Tumuwonile Mtwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Tomasi akavalongela, “Nene pendiwene makofu gya misumali mumawoko gyake na kuvika kyala kyangu mumakofu gyake na kuvika liwoko lyangu mulubafu lwake, sendidikila.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Pevichumbile figono fimnana, vachulila vake vakatanganile pamwi mugati lya kaye pamwi na Tomasi, kuno milyangilo gikali gidindilwe, ndeni Yesu akachile, akahimile mugati lyawo, akalonga, “Lutangamaso iveche na nyenye!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Baho akamlongile Tomasi, “Vike kyala kyako baha na ulole mawoko gyangu, baho ugolole liwoko lwako uvike lubafu lwangu. Ubihile kwogofya ila dikile!”<verse eid="JHN 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi akamuhigile, “Mtwa vangu kangi veve ndi Nguluvi vangu!”<verse eid="JHN 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu akamlongela, “Wuli, udikile kwakuva undiwonile? Ngiba kwa vala vevadikile, ila sevawene!”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Natilo lya kiganulo ikyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu akagitile fimanyilo fyolofu pautalo lya vachulila vake, chesechisimbilwe mukiganulo iki. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Ila ichi chisimbilwe neke mpatile kudikila kuva Yesu ndi Kilisito yeahuguliwe na Nguluvi, Mwana va Nguluvi na kwa kudikila muveche na uwumi va mbepali.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu akuvahumila vachulila saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Pegachumbile ago, Yesu akavahumila kangi vachulila vake mung'umbu lya lihiva Tibelia nde lihiva Galilaya. Ndeni nde peikali. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Peteli na Tomasi yeikemelwa Pacha na Natanieli yula yeahumile Kana inyi lya ku Galilaya na vana vavili va Sebedayo na vachulila vake vangi vavili va Yesu vekali pamwi. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Peteli akavalongie, “Ndihelela kulowa somba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Navo vakamlongela, “Nefwe datuhelela pamwi na veve.” Suwe, vakahelela, vakakang'ale wato, ila pamie ponda sevapatile ata somba yumwi. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Pepavangile kukiya Yesu akahimile mung'umbu lya lihiva, ila vachulila sevakamchele kuva ndi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu akavahuchile, “Vaganja vangu, wuli, sempatile ata somba yoyonda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">Vene vakamuhigile, “Setupatile somba yeyonda.”<verse eid="JHN 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu akavalongela, “Mtage nyafu palubali lya ndewo lya wato na damwipata somba.” Ndeni vakataga nyafu chawo na sevakavesile kuchikwegela nyafu muwato, kwakuva somba vakali volofu.<verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Baho yula mchulila yeakeliwe na Yesu akamlongela Peteli, “Yula ndi Mtwa!” Simoni Peteli peapulike kuva yula ndi Mtwa, akategule mwenda vake akayiwopile mukigudi, kwakuva seafwalile mwenda vake gungi na akadumbukile mumalenga. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Ila vala vachulila vangi vakachile na wato kumwambo lya lihiva, kuno vikwega nyafu weumemile somba. Sevakali patali na inyi ng'afu, pakali ngita magulu miya ndeni. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pevafikile mung'umbung'umbu, vakawene lyoto lwa makala na kukyanya lyake kuvikilwe somba na libumunda. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu akavalongie, “Mulete somba vakefu gyemulowe.”<verse eid="JHN 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simoni Peteli akakang'ile muwato na akakwega nyafu mung'umbung'umbu lya lihiva na ugehe na somba vakomi mia yimwi na amsini na chidatu. Ata ngita somba vakali volofu ila nyafu seidemwike. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu akavalongie, “Mwache muliye.” Kwihela ata mchulila yeagechile kumuhucha, kuva “Veve ani?” Kwakuva vachele kuva mwene ndi Mtwa. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu akachile, akategula libumunda na akavagavila na vala somba akagitile ndeni.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Iyi ikali mala chidatu Yesu kuvahumila vachulila vake kuhuma peachulubuke.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ilonga na Peteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pevasindile kuliya, Yesu akamuhucha Simoni Peteli, “Simoni mwana va Yohani! Wuli, ukunikela nene kuchumba vayago?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Akamuhigile, “Ena, Mtwa, uchela kuva ndikukukela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Yesu akamlongie, “Valolele vanang'ondolo vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Yesu akamuhucha kangi, “Simoni mwana va Yohani! Wuli, ukundikela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Akamuhigile, “Ena, Mtwa, uchela kuva ndikukukela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Yesu akamlongie, “Ndilolele ng'ondolo vangu.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Akamuhucha mala chidatu, “Simoni mwana va Yohani! Wuli, ukundikela?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Baho Peteli akasugwime munumbula lyake kwakuva amuhuchile mala chidatu, “Wuli, ukundikela?” Mweni akamuhigile, “Mtwa, veve uchela kuva nene ndikukukela.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Yesu akamlongie “Valolele vanang'ondolo vangu. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Ndakyene ndikulongela, peukali mdimi ukachovie kwiwopa lufunga yuve na kuhehela kweukela, ila peuvecha mgogolo ukonjolola mawoko gyako na munu yungi akufwalisa na kukusindika kweseukela kuhelela.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />Yesu alongie ndeni, awonise kuva Peteli dapeafuwa na kufuwa kwamwene peukumletela Nguluvi ukomi vake. Baho Yesu akamlongie, “Ndifwate.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na yula mchulila yungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Peteli akaseduke, akamuwene yula mchulila yungi yeakeliwe hilo na Yesu, akuvafuwatila, ayu mchulila nde yula yeakalile pepi na Yesu pevakali viliya na kumuhucha, “Mtwa ani yeakukana?” <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Peteli peamuwonile uyu, akamuhucha Yesu, “Mtwa, wuli munu uyu?”<verse eid="JHN 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu akamuhigile, “Ngita ndikela asigale mbaka pendikwacha, wisaka liki? Veve ndifwate nene!”<verse eid="JHN 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Makani gala gya Yesu chikalutala kwa vanu kuva mchulila yula seafua. Ila Yesu sealongile kuva yula mchulila seafua, mwene alongile kuva, “Ngita ndikela asigale mbaka pendikwacha, wisaka liki?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Uyu nde yula yealongile makani aga na ndeyeasimbiliye na tuchela kuva yealongile ndi ndakyene.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usindilicho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Ila kugehe na njowo chongofu cheagitile Yesu, ngita ngagasimbilwe gonda, ndihocha inyi yonda ngaikali ndodo kuvika figanulo fyonda ngafisimbilwe.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>